  <para style="h">Mark</para>
  <para style="toc1">mArkalikhitaH susaMvAdaH</para>
  <para style="toc2">mArkaH</para>
  <para style="toc3">mArkaH</para>
  <para style="mt1">mArkalikhitaH susaMvAdaH</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Izvaraputrasya yIzukhrISTasya susaMvAdArambhaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>bhaviSyadvAdinAM grantheSu lipiritthamAste, pazya svakIyadUtantu tavAgre preSayAmyaham| gatvA tvadIyapanthAnaM sa hi pariSkariSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>"paramezasya panthAnaM pariSkuruta sarvvataH| tasya rAjapathaJcaiva samAnaM kurutAdhunA|" ityetat prAntare vAkyaM vadataH kasyacidravaH||</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>saeva yohan prAntare majjitavAn tathA pApamArjananimittaM manovyAvarttakamajjanasya kathAJca pracAritavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>tato yihUdAdezayirUzAlamnagaranivAsinaH sarvve lokA bahi rbhUtvA tasya samIpamAgatya svAni svAni pApAnyaGgIkRtya yarddananadyAM tena majjitA babhUvuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>asya yohanaH paridheyAni kramelakalomajAni, tasya kaTibandhanaM carmmajAtam, tasya bhakSyANi ca zUkakITA vanyamadhUni cAsan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>sa pracArayan kathayAJcakre, ahaM namrIbhUya yasya pAdukAbandhanaM mocayitumapi na yogyosmi, tAdRzo matto gurutara ekaH puruSo matpazcAdAgacchati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>ahaM yuSmAn jale majjitavAn kintu sa pavitra AtmAni saMmajjayiSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>aparaJca tasminneva kAle gAlIlpradezasya nAsaradgrAmAd yIzurAgatya yohanA yarddananadyAM majjito'bhUt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>sa jalAdutthitamAtro meghadvAraM muktaM kapotavat svasyopari avarohantamAtmAnaJca dRSTavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>tvaM mama priyaH putrastvayyeva mamamahAsantoSa iyamAkAzIyA vANI babhUva|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>tasmin kAle AtmA taM prAntaramadhyaM ninAya|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>atha sa catvAriMzaddinAni tasmin sthAne vanyapazubhiH saha tiSThan zaitAnA parIkSitaH; pazcAt svargIyadUtAstaM siSevire|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>anantaraM yohani bandhanAlaye baddhe sati yIzu rgAlIlpradezamAgatya IzvararAjyasya susaMvAdaM pracArayan kathayAmAsa,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>kAlaH sampUrNa IzvararAjyaJca samIpamAgataM; atoheto ryUyaM manAMsi vyAvarttayadhvaM susaMvAde ca vizvAsita|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>tadanantaraM sa gAlIlIyasamudrasya tIre gacchan zimon tasya bhrAtA andriyanAmA ca imau dvau janau matsyadhAriNau sAgaramadhye jAlaM prakSipantau dRSTvA tAvavadat,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>yuvAM mama pazcAdAgacchataM, yuvAmahaM manuSyadhAriNau kariSyAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>tatastau tatkSaNameva jAlAni parityajya tasya pazcAt jagmatuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>tataH paraM tatsthAnAt kiJcid dUraM gatvA sa sivadIputrayAkUb tadbhrAtRyohan ca imau naukAyAM jAlAnAM jIrNamuddhArayantau dRSTvA tAvAhUyat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>tatastau naukAyAM vetanabhugbhiH sahitaM svapitaraM vihAya tatpazcAdIyatuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>tataH paraM kapharnAhUmnAmakaM nagaramupasthAya sa vizrAmadivase bhajanagrahaM pravizya samupadideza|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>tasyopadezAllokA AzcaryyaM menire yataH sodhyApakAiva nopadizan prabhAvavAniva propadideza|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>aparaJca tasmin bhajanagRhe apavitrabhUtena grasta eko mAnuSa AsIt| sa cItzabdaM kRtvA kathayAJcake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>bho nAsaratIya yIzo tvamasmAn tyaja, tvayA sahAsmAkaM kaH sambandhaH? tvaM kimasmAn nAzayituM samAgataH? tvamIzvarasya pavitraloka ityahaM jAnAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>tadA yIzustaM tarjayitvA jagAda tUSNIM bhava ito bahirbhava ca|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>tataH so'pavitrabhUtastaM sampIDya atyucaizcItkRtya nirjagAma|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>tenaiva sarvve camatkRtya parasparaM kathayAJcakrire, aho kimidaM? kIdRzo'yaM navya upadezaH? anena prabhAvenApavitrabhUteSvAjJApiteSu te tadAjJAnuvarttino bhavanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>tadA tasya yazo gAlIlazcaturdiksthasarvvadezAn vyApnot|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>aparaJca te bhajanagRhAd bahi rbhUtvA yAkUbyohanbhyAM saha zimona Andriyasya ca nivezanaM pravivizuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>tadA pitarasya zvazrUrjvarapIDitA zayyAyAmAsta iti te taM jhaTiti vijJApayAJcakruH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>tataH sa Agatya tasyA hastaM dhRtvA tAmudasthApayat; tadaiva tAM jvaro'tyAkSIt tataH paraM sA tAn siSeve|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>athAstaM gate ravau sandhyAkAle sati lokAstatsamIpaM sarvvAn rogiNo bhUtadhRtAMzca samAninyuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>sarvve nAgarikA lokA dvAri saMmilitAzca|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>tataH sa nAnAvidharogiNo bahUn manujAnarogiNazcakAra tathA bahUn bhUtAn tyAjayAJcakAra tAn bhUtAn kimapi vAkyaM vaktuM niSiSedha ca yatohetoste tamajAnan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>aparaJca so'tipratyUSe vastutastu rAtrizeSe samutthAya bahirbhUya nirjanaM sthAnaM gatvA tatra prArthayAJcakre|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>anantaraM zimon tatsaGginazca tasya pazcAd gatavantaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>taduddezaM prApya tamavadan sarvve lokAstvAM mRgayante|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>tadA so'kathayat Agacchata vayaM samIpasthAni nagarANi yAmaH, yato'haM tatra kathAM pracArayituM bahirAgamam|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>atha sa teSAM gAlIlpradezasya sarvveSu bhajanagRheSu kathAH pracArayAJcakre bhUtAnatyAjayaJca|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>anantaramekaH kuSThI samAgatya tatsammukhe jAnupAtaM vinayaJca kRtvA kathitavAn yadi bhavAn icchati tarhi mAM pariSkarttuM zaknoti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>tataH kRpAlu ryIzuH karau prasAryya taM spaSTvA kathayAmAsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>mamecchA vidyate tvaM pariSkRto bhava| etatkathAyAH kathanamAtrAt sa kuSThI rogAnmuktaH pariSkRto'bhavat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>tadA sa taM visRjan gADhamAdizya jagAda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>sAvadhAno bhava kathAmimAM kamapi mA vada; svAtmAnaM yAjakaM darzaya, lokebhyaH svapariSkRteH pramANadAnAya mUsAnirNItaM yaddAnaM tadutsRjasva ca|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>kintu sa gatvA tat karmma itthaM vistAryya pracArayituM prArebhe tenaiva yIzuH punaH saprakAzaM nagaraM praveSTuM nAzaknot tatohetorbahiH kAnanasthAne tasyau; tathApi caturddigbhyo lokAstasya samIpamAyayuH|</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>tadanantaraM yIzai katipayadinAni vilambya punaH kapharnAhUmnagaraM praviSTe sa gRha Asta iti kiMvadantyA tatkSaNaM tatsamIpaM bahavo lokA Agatya samupatasthuH,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>tasmAd gRhamadhye sarvveSAM kRte sthAnaM nAbhavad dvArasya caturdikSvapi nAbhavat, tatkAle sa tAn prati kathAM pracArayAJcakre|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>tataH paraM lokAzcaturbhi rmAnavairekaM pakSAghAtinaM vAhayitvA tatsamIpam AninyuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>kintu janAnAM bahutvAt taM yIzoH sammukhamAnetuM na zaknuvanto yasmin sthAne sa Aste taduparigRhapRSThaM khanitvA chidraM kRtvA tena mArgeNa sazayyaM pakSAghAtinam avarohayAmAsuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>tato yIzusteSAM vizvAsaM dRSTvA taM pakSAghAtinaM babhASe he vatsa tava pApAnAM mArjanaM bhavatu|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>tadA kiyanto'dhyApakAstatropavizanto manobhi rvitarkayAJcakruH, eSa manuSya etAdRzImIzvaranindAM kathAM kutaH kathayati?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>IzvaraM vinA pApAni mArSTuM kasya sAmarthyam Aste?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>itthaM te vitarkayanti yIzustatkSaNaM manasA tad budvvA tAnavadad yUyamantaHkaraNaiH kuta etAni vitarkayatha?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>tadanantaraM yIzustatsthAnAt punaH samudrataTaM yayau; lokanivahe tatsamIpamAgate sa tAn samupadideza|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>kintu pRthivyAM pApAni mArSTuM manuSyaputrasya sAmarthyamasti, etad yuSmAn jJApayituM (sa tasmai pakSAghAtine kathayAmAsa)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>uttiSTha tava zayyAM gRhItvA svagRhaM yAhi, ahaM tvAmidam AjJApayAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>tataH sa tatkSaNam utthAya zayyAM gRhItvA sarvveSAM sAkSAt jagAma; sarvve vismitA etAdRzaM karmma vayam kadApi nApazyAma, imAM kathAM kathayitvezvaraM dhanyamabruvan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>tadanantaraM yIzustatsthAnAt punaH samudrataTaM yayau; lokanivahe tatsamIpamAgate sa tAn samupadideza|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>atha gacchan karasaJcayagRha upaviSTam AlphIyaputraM leviM dRSTvA tamAhUya kathitavAn matpazcAt tvAmAmaccha tataH sa utthAya tatpazcAd yayau|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>anantaraM yIzau tasya gRhe bhoktum upaviSTe bahavaH karamaJcAyinaH pApinazca tena tacchiSyaizca sahopavivizuH, yato bahavastatpazcAdAjagmuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>tadA sa karamaJcAyibhiH pApibhizca saha khAdati, tad dRSTvAdhyApakAH phirUzinazca tasya ziSyAnUcuH karamaJcAyibhiH pApibhizca sahAyaM kuto bhuMkte pivati ca?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>tadvAkyaM zrutvA yIzuH pratyuvAca,arogilokAnAM cikitsakena prayojanaM nAsti, kintu rogiNAmeva; ahaM dhArmmikAnAhvAtuM nAgataH kintu mano vyAvarttayituM pApina eva|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>tataH paraM yohanaH phirUzinAJcopavAsAcAriziSyA yIzoH samIpam Agatya kathayAmAsuH, yohanaH phirUzinAJca ziSyA upavasanti kintu bhavataH ziSyA nopavasanti kiM kAraNamasya?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>tadA yIzustAn babhASe yAvat kAlaM sakhibhiH saha kanyAyA varastiSThati tAvatkAlaM te kimupavastuM zaknuvanti? yAvatkAlaM varastaiH saha tiSThati tAvatkAlaM ta upavastuM na zaknuvanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>yasmin kAle tebhyaH sakAzAd varo neSyate sa kAla Agacchati, tasmin kAle te janA upavatsyanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>kopi janaH purAtanavastre nUtanavastraM na sIvyati, yato nUtanavastreNa saha sevane kRte jIrNaM vastraM chidyate tasmAt puna rmahat chidraM jAyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>kopi janaH purAtanakutUSu nUtanaM drAkSArasaM na sthApayati, yato nUtanadrAkSArasasya tejasA tAH kutvo vidIryyante tato drAkSArasazca patati kutvazca nazyanti, ataeva nUtanadrAkSAraso nUtanakutUSu sthApanIyaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>tadanantaraM yIzu ryadA vizrAmavAre zasyakSetreNa gacchati tadA tasya ziSyA gacchantaH zasyamaJjarIzchettuM pravRttAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>ataH phirUzino yIzave kathayAmAsuH pazyatu vizrAmavAsare yat karmma na karttavyaM tad ime kutaH kurvvanti?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>tadA sa tebhyo'kathayat dAyUd tatsaMGginazca bhakSyAbhAvAt kSudhitAH santo yat karmma kRtavantastat kiM yuSmAbhi rna paThitam?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>abiyAtharnAmake mahAyAjakatAM kurvvati sa kathamIzvarasyAvAsaM pravizya ye darzanIyapUpA yAjakAn vinAnyasya kasyApi na bhakSyAstAneva bubhuje saGgilokebhyo'pi dadau|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>so'paramapi jagAda, vizrAmavAro manuSyArthameva nirUpito'sti kintu manuSyo vizrAmavArArthaM naiva|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>manuSyaputro vizrAmavArasyApi prabhurAste|</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>anantaraM yIzuH puna rbhajanagRhaM praviSTastasmin sthAne zuSkahasta eko mAnava AsIt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>sa vizrAmavAre tamarogiNaM kariSyati navetyatra bahavastam apavadituM chidramapekSitavantaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>tadA sa taM zuSkahastaM manuSyaM jagAda madhyasthAne tvamuttiSTha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>tataH paraM sa tAn papraccha vizrAmavAre hitamahitaM tathA hi prANarakSA vA prANanAza eSAM madhye kiM karaNIyaM ? kintu te niHzabdAstasthuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>tadA sa teSAmantaHkaraNAnAM kAThinyAddheto rduHkhitaH krodhAt cartuिdazo dRSTavAn taM mAnuSaM gaditavAn taM hastaM vistAraya, tatastena haste vistRte taddhasto'nyahastavad arogo jAtaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>atha phirUzinaH prasthAya taM nAzayituM herodIyaiH saha mantrayitumArebhire|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>ataeva yIzustatsthAnaM parityajya ziSyaiH saha punaH sAgarasamIpaM gataH;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>tato gAlIlyihUdA-yirUzAlam-idom-yardannadIpArasthAnebhyo lokasamUhastasya pazcAd gataH; tadanyaH sorasIdanoH samIpavAsilokasamUhazca tasya mahAkarmmaNAM vArttaM zrutvA tasya sannidhimAgataH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>tadA lokasamUhazcet tasyopari patati ityAzaGkya sa nAvamekAM nikaTe sthApayituM ziSyAnAdiSTavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>yato'nekamanuSyANAmArogyakaraNAd vyAdhigrastAH sarvve taM spraSTuM parasparaM balena yatnavantaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>aparaJca apavitrabhUtAstaM dRSTvA taccaraNayoH patitvA procaiH procuH, tvamIzvarasya putraH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>kintu sa tAn dRDham AjJApya svaM paricAyituM niSiddhavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>anantaraM sa parvvatamAruhya yaM yaM praticchA taM tamAhUtavAn tataste tatsamIpamAgatAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>tadA sa dvAdazajanAn svena saha sthAtuM susaMvAdapracArAya preritA bhavituM</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>sarvvaprakAravyAdhInAM zamanakaraNAya prabhAvaM prAptuM bhUtAn tyAjayituJca niyuktavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>teSAM nAmAnImAni, zimon sivadiputro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>yAkUb tasya bhrAtA yohan ca AndriyaH philipo barthalamayaH,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>mathI thomA ca AlphIyaputro yAkUb thaddIyaH kinAnIyaH zimon yastaM parahasteSvarpayiSyati sa ISkariyotIyayihUdAzca|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>sa zimone pitara ityupanAma dadau yAkUbyohanbhyAM ca binerigiz arthato meghanAdaputrAvityupanAma dadau|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>anantaraM te nivezanaM gatAH, kintu tatrApi punarmahAn janasamAgamo 'bhavat tasmAtte bhoktumapyavakAzaM na prAptAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>tatastasya suhRllokA imAM vArttAM prApya sa hatajJAnobhUd iti kathAM kathayitvA taM dhRtvAnetuM gatAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>aparaJca yirUzAlama AgatA ye ye'dhyApakAste jagadurayaM puruSo bhUtapatyAbiSTastena bhUtapatinA bhUtAn tyAjayati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>tatastAnAhUya yIzu rdRSTAntaiH kathAM kathitavAn zaitAn kathaM zaitAnaM tyAjayituM zaknoti?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>kiJcana rAjyaM yadi svavirodhena pRthag bhavati tarhi tad rAjyaM sthiraM sthAtuM na zaknoti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>tathA kasyApi parivAro yadi parasparaM virodhI bhavati tarhi sopi parivAraH sthiraM sthAtuM na zaknoti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>tadvat zaitAn yadi svavipakSatayA uttiSThan bhinno bhavati tarhi sopi sthiraM sthAtuM na zaknoti kintUcchinno bhavati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>aparaJca prabalaM janaM prathamaM na baddhA kopi tasya gRhaM pravizya dravyANi luNThayituM na zaknoti, taM badvvaiva tasya gRhasya dravyANi luNThayituM zaknoti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>atoheto ryuSmabhyamahaM satyaM kathayAmi manuSyANAM santAnA yAni yAni pApAnIzvaranindAJca kurvvanti teSAM tatsarvveSAmaparAdhAnAM kSamA bhavituM zaknoti,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>kintu yaH kazcit pavitramAtmAnaM nindati tasyAparAdhasya kSamA kadApi na bhaviSyati sonantadaNDasyArho bhaviSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>tasyApavitrabhUto'sti teSAmetatkathAhetoH sa itthaM kathitavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>atha tasya mAtA bhrAtRgaNazcAgatya bahistiSThanato lokAn preSya tamAhUtavantaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>tatastatsannidhau samupaviSTA lokAstaM babhASire pazya bahistava mAtA bhrAtarazca tvAm anvicchanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>tadA sa tAn pratyuvAca mama mAtA kA bhrAtaro vA ke? tataH paraM sa svamIpopaviSTAn ziSyAn prati avalokanaM kRtvA kathayAmAsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>pazyataite mama mAtA bhrAtarazca|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>yaH kazcid IzvarasyeSTAM kriyAM karoti sa eva mama bhrAtA bhaginI mAtA ca|</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>anantaraM sa samudrataTe punarupadeSTuM prArebhe, tatastatra bahujanAnAM samAgamAt sa sAgaropari naukAmAruhya samupaviSTaH; sarvve lokAH samudrakUle tasthuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>tadA sa dRSTAntakathAbhi rbahUpadiSTavAn upadizaMzca kathitavAn,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>avadhAnaM kuruta, eko bIjavaptA bIjAni vaptuM gataH;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>vapanakAle kiyanti bIjAni mArgapAzve patitAni, tata AkAzIyapakSiNa etya tAni cakhAduH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>kiyanti bIjAni svalpamRttikAvatpASANabhUmau patitAni tAni mRdolpatvAt zIghramaGkuritAni;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>kintUdite sUryye dagdhAni tathA mUlAno nAdhogatatvAt zuSkANi ca|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>kiyanti bIjAni kaNTakivanamadhye patitAni tataH kaNTakAni saMvRdvya tAni jagrasustAni na ca phalitAni|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>tathA kiyanti bIjAnyuttamabhUmau patitAni tAni saMvRdvya phalAnyutpAditAni kiyanti bIjAni triMzadguNAni kiyanti SaSTiguNAni kiyanti zataguNAni phalAni phalitavanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>atha sa tAnavadat yasya zrotuM karNau staH sa zRNotu|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>tadanantaraM nirjanasamaye tatsaGgino dvAdazaziSyAzca taM taddRSTAntavAkyasyArthaM papracchuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>tadA sa tAnuditavAn IzvararAjyasya nigUDhavAkyaM boddhuM yuSmAkamadhikAro'sti;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>kintu ye vahirbhUtAH "te pazyantaH pazyanti kintu na jAnanti, zRNvantaH zRNvanti kintu na budhyante, cettai rmanaHsu kadApi parivarttiteSu teSAM pApAnyamocayiSyanta," atohetostAn prati dRSTAntaireva tAni mayA kathitAni|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>atha sa kathitavAn yUyaM kimetad dRSTAntavAkyaM na budhyadhve? tarhi kathaM sarvvAn dRSTAntAna bhotsyadhve?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>bIjavaptA vAkyarUpANi bIjAni vapati;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>tatra ye ye lokA vAkyaM zRNvanti, kintu zrutamAtrAt zaitAn zIghramAgatya teSAM manaHsUptAni tAni vAkyarUpANi bIjAnyapanayati taeva uptabIjamArgapArzvesvarUpAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>ye janA vAkyaM zrutvA sahasA paramAnandena gRhlanti, kintu hRdi sthairyyAbhAvAt kiJcit kAlamAtraM tiSThanti tatpazcAt tadvAkyahetoH</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>kutracit kleze upadrave vA samupasthite tadaiva vighnaM prApnuvanti taeva uptabIjapASANabhUmisvarUpAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>ye janAH kathAM zRNvanti kintu sAMsArikI cintA dhanabhrAnti rviSayalobhazca ete sarvve upasthAya tAM kathAM grasanti tataH mA viphalA bhavati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>taeva uptabIjasakaNTakabhUmisvarUpAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>ye janA vAkyaM zrutvA gRhlanti teSAM kasya vA triMzadguNAni kasya vA SaSTiguNAni kasya vA zataguNAni phalAni bhavanti taeva uptabIjorvvarabhUmisvarUpAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>tadA so'paramapi kathitavAn kopi jano dIpAdhAraM parityajya droNasyAdhaH khaTvAyA adhe vA sthApayituM dIpamAnayati kiM?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>atoheto ryanna prakAzayiSyate tAdRg lukkAyitaM kimapi vastu nAsti; yad vyaktaM na bhaviSyati tAdRzaM guptaM kimapi vastu nAsti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>yasya zrotuM karNau staH sa zRNotu|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>aparamapi kathitavAn yUyaM yad yad vAkyaM zRNutha tatra sAvadhAnA bhavata, yato yUyaM yena parimANena parimAtha tenaiva parimANena yuSmadarthamapi parimAsyate; zrotAro yUyaM yuSmabhyamadhikaM dAsyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>yasyAzraye varddhate tasmai aparamapi dAsyate, kintu yasyAzraye na varddhate tasya yat kiJcidasti tadapi tasmAn neSyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>anantaraM sa kathitavAn eko lokaH kSetre bIjAnyuptvA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>jAgaraNanidrAbhyAM divAnizaM gamayati, parantu tadvIjaM tasyAjJAtarUpeNAGkurayati varddhate ca;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>yatohetoH prathamataH patrANi tataH paraM kaNizAni tatpazcAt kaNizapUrNAni zasyAni bhUmiH svayamutpAdayati;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>kintu phaleSu pakkeSu zasyacchedanakAlaM jJAtvA sa tatkSaNaM zasyAni chinatti, anena tulyamIzvararAjyaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>punaH so'kathayad IzvararAjyaM kena samaM? kena vastunA saha vA tadupamAsyAmi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>tat sarSapaikena tulyaM yato mRdi vapanakAle sarSapabIjaM sarvvapRthivIsthabIjAt kSudraM</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>kintu vapanAt param aGkurayitvA sarvvazAkAd bRhad bhavati, tasya bRhatyaH zAkhAzca jAyante tatastacchAyAM pakSiNa Azrayante|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>itthaM teSAM bodhAnurUpaM so'nekadRSTAntaistAnupadiSTavAn,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>dRSTAntaM vinA kAmapi kathAM tebhyo na kathitavAn pazcAn nirjane sa ziSyAn sarvvadRSTAntArthaM bodhitavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>taddinasya sandhyAyAM sa tebhyo'kathayad Agacchata vayaM pAraM yAma|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>tadA te lokAn visRjya tamavilambaM gRhItvA naukayA pratasthire; aparA api nAvastayA saha sthitAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>tataH paraM mahAjhaJbhzagamAt nau rdolAyamAnA taraGgeNa jalaiH pUrNAbhavacca|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>tadA sa naukAcazcAdbhAge upadhAne ziro nidhAya nidrita AsIt tataste taM jAgarayitvA jagaduH, he prabho, asmAkaM prANA yAnti kimatra bhavatazcintA nAsti?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>tadA sa utthAya vAyuM tarjitavAn samudraJcoktavAn zAntaH susthirazca bhava; tato vAyau nivRtte'bdhirnistaraGgobhUt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>tadA sa tAnuvAca yUyaM kuta etAdRkzaGkAkulA bhavata? kiM vo vizvAso nAsti?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>tasmAtte'tIvabhItAH parasparaM vaktumArebhire, aho vAyuH sindhuzcAsya nidezagrAhiNau kIdRgayaM manujaH|</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>atha tU sindhupAraM gatvA giderIyapradeza upatasthuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>naukAto nirgatamAtrAd apavitrabhUtagrasta ekaH zmazAnAdetya taM sAkSAc cakAra|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>sa zmazAne'vAtsIt kopi taM zRGkhalena badvvA sthApayituM nAzaknot|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>janairvAraM nigaDaiH zRGkhalaizca sa baddhopi zRGkhalAnyAkRSya mocitavAn nigaDAni ca bhaMktvA khaNDaM khaNDaM kRtavAn kopi taM vazIkarttuM na zazaka|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>divAnizaM sadA parvvataM zmazAnaJca bhramitvA cItzabdaM kRtavAn grAvabhizca svayaM svaM kRtavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>sa yIzuM dUrAt pazyanneva dhAvan taM praNanAma ucairuvaMzcovAca,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>he sarvvoparisthezvaraputra yIzo bhavatA saha me kaH sambandhaH? ahaM tvAmIzvareNa zApaye mAM mA yAtaya|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>yato yIzustaM kathitavAn re apavitrabhUta, asmAnnarAd bahirnirgaccha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>atha sa taM pRSTavAn kinte nAma? tena pratyuktaM vayamaneke 'smastato'smannAma bAhinI|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>tatosmAn dezAnna preSayeti te taM prArthayanta|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>tadAnIM parvvataM nikaSA bRhan varAhavrajazcarannAsIt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>tasmAd bhUtA vinayena jagaduH, amuM varAhavrajam Azrayitum asmAn prahiNu|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>yIzunAnujJAtAste'pavitrabhUtA bahirniryAya varAhavrajaM prAvizan tataH sarvve varAhA vastutastu prAyodvisahasrasaMGkhyakAH kaTakena mahAjavAd dhAvantaH sindhau prANAn jahuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>tasmAd varAhapAlakAH palAyamAnAH pure grAme ca tadvArttaM kathayAJcakruH| tadA lokA ghaTitaM tatkAryyaM draSTuM bahirjagmuH</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>yIzoH sannidhiM gatvA taM bhUtagrastam arthAd bAhinIbhUtagrastaM naraM savastraM sacetanaM samupaviSTaJca dRृSTvA bibhyuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>tato dRSTatatkAryyalokAstasya bhUtagrastanarasya varAhavrajasyApi tAM dhaTanAM varNayAmAsuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>tataste svasImAto bahirgantuM yIzuM vinetumArebhire|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>atha tasya naukArohaNakAle sa bhUtamukto nA yIzunA saha sthAtuM prArthayate;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>kintu sa tamananumatya kathitavAn tvaM nijAtmIyAnAM samIpaM gRhaJca gaccha prabhustvayi kRpAM kRtvA yAni karmmANi kRtavAn tAni tAn jJApaya|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>ataH sa prasthAya yIzunA kRtaM tatsarvvAzcaryyaM karmma dikApalideze pracArayituM prArabdhavAn tataH sarvve lokA AzcaryyaM menire|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>anantaraM yIzau nAvA punaranyapAra uttIrNe sindhutaTe ca tiSThati sati tatsamIpe bahulokAnAM samAgamo'bhUt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>aparaM yAyIr nAmnA kazcid bhajanagRhasyAdhipa Agatya taM dRSTvaiva caraNayoH patitvA bahu nivedya kathitavAn;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>mama kanyA mRtaprAyAbhUd ato bhavAnetya tadArogyAya tasyA gAtre hastam arpayatu tenaiva sA jIviSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>tadA yIzustena saha calitaH kintu tatpazcAd bahulokAzcalitvA tAdgAtre patitAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>atha dvAdazavarSANi pradararogeNa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>zIrNA cikitsakAnAM nAnAcikitsAbhizca duHkhaM bhuktavatI ca sarvvasvaM vyayitvApi nArogyaM prAptA ca punarapi pIDitAsIcca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>yA strI sA yIzo rvArttAM prApya manasAkathayat yadyahaM tasya vastramAtra spraSTuM labheyaM tadA rogahInA bhaviSyAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>atohetoH sA lokAraNyamadhye tatpazcAdAgatya tasya vastraM pasparza|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>tenaiva tatkSaNaM tasyA raktasrotaH zuSkaM svayaM tasmAd rogAnmuktA ityapi dehe'nubhUtA|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>atha svasmAt zakti rnirgatA yIzuretanmanasA jJAtvA lokanivahaM prati mukhaM vyAvRtya pRSTavAn kena madvastraM spRSTaM?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>tatastasya ziSyA UcuH bhavato vapuSi lokAH saMgharSanti tad dRSTvA kena madvastraM spRSTamiti kutaH kathayati?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>kintu kena tat karmma kRtaM tad draSTuM yIzuzcaturdizo dRSTavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>tataH sA strI bhItA kampitA ca satI svasyA rukpratikriyA jAteti jJAtvAgatya tatsammukhe patitvA sarvvavRttAntaM satyaM tasmai kathayAmAsa|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>tadAnIM yIzustAM gaditavAn, he kanye tava pratItistvAm arogAmakarot tvaM kSemeNa vraja svarogAnmuktA ca tiSTha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>itivAkyavadanakAle bhajanagRhAdhipasya nivezanAl lokA etyAdhipaM babhASire tava kanyA mRtA tasmAd guruM punaH kutaH kliznAsi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>kintu yIzustad vAkyaM zrutvaiva bhajanagRhAdhipaM gaditavAn mA bhaiSIH kevalaM vizvAsihi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>atha pitaro yAkUb tadbhrAtA yohan ca etAn vinA kamapi svapazcAd yAtuM nAnvamanyata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>tasya bhajanagRhAdhipasya nivezanasamIpam Agatya kalahaM bahurodanaM vilApaJca kurvvato lokAn dadarza|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>tasmAn nivezanaM pravizya proktavAn yUyaM kuta itthaM kalahaM rodanaJca kurutha? kanyA na mRtA nidrAti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>tasmAtte tamupajahasuH kintu yIzuH sarvvAna bahiSkRtya kanyAyAH pitarau svasaGginazca gRhItvA yatra kanyAsIt tat sthAnaM praviSTavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>atha sa tasyAH kanyAyA hastau dhRtvA tAM babhASe TAlIthA kUmI, arthato he kanye tvamuttiSTha ityAjJApayAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>tunaiva tatkSaNaM sA dvAdazavarSavayaskA kanyA potthAya calitumArebhe, itaH sarvve mahAvismayaM gatAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>tata etasyai kiJcit khAdyaM datteti kathayitvA etatkarmma kamapi na jJApayateti dRDhamAdiSTavAn|</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>anantaraM sa tatsthAnAt prasthAya svapradezamAgataH ziSyAzca tatpazcAd gatAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>atha vizrAmavAre sati sa bhajanagRhe upadeSTumArabdhavAn tato'neke lokAstatkathAM zrutvA vismitya jagaduH, asya manujasya IdRzI AzcaryyakriyA kasmAj jAtA? tathA svakarAbhyAm itthamadbhutaM karmma karttAुm etasmai kathaM jJAnaM dattam?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>kimayaM mariyamaH putrastajJA no? kimayaM yAkUb-yosi-yihudA-zimonAM bhrAtA no? asya bhaginyaH kimihAsmAbhiH saha no? itthaM te tadarthe pratyUhaM gatAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>tadA yIzustebhyo'kathayat svadezaM svakuTumbAn svaparijanAMzca vinA kutrApi bhaviSyadvAdI asatkRto na bhavati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>aparaJca teSAmapratyayAt sa vismitaH kiyatAM rogiNAM vapuHSu hastam arpayitvA kevalaM teSAmArogyakaraNAd anyat kimapi citrakAryyaM karttAM na zaktaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>atha sa caturdikstha grAmAn bhramitvA upadiSTavAn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>dvAdazaziSyAn AhUya amedhyabhUtAn vazIkarttAM zaktiM dattvA teSAM dvau dvau jano preSitavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>punarityAdizad yUyam ekaikAM yaSTiM vinA vastrasaMpuTaH pUpaH kaTibandhe tAmrakhaNDaJca eSAM kimapi mA grahlIta,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>mArgayAtrAyai pAdeSUpAnahau dattvA dve uttarIye mA paridhadvvaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>aparamapyuktaM tena yUyaM yasyAM puryyAM yasya nivezanaM pravekSyatha tAM purIM yAvanna tyakSyatha tAvat tannivezane sthAsyatha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>tatra yadi kepi yuSmAkamAtithyaM na vidadhati yuSmAkaM kathAzca na zRNvanti tarhi tatsthAnAt prasthAnasamaye teSAM viruddhaM sAkSyaM dAtuM svapAdAnAsphAlya rajaH sampAtayata; ahaM yuSmAn yathArthaM vacmi vicAradine tannagarasyAvasthAtaH sidomAmorayo rnagarayoravasthA sahyatarA bhaviSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>atha te gatvA lokAnAM manaHparAvarttanIH kathA pracAritavantaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>evamanekAn bhUtAMzca tyAjitavantastathA tailena marddayitvA bahUn janAnarogAnakArSuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>itthaM tasya sukhyAtizcaturdizo vyAptA tadA herod rAjA tannizamya kathitavAn, yohan majjakaH zmazAnAd utthita atohetostena sarvvA etA adbhutakriyAH prakAzante|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>anye'kathayan ayam eliyaH, kepi kathitavanta eSa bhaviSyadvAdI yadvA bhaviSyadvAdinAM sadRza ekoyam|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>kintu herod ityAkarNya bhASitavAn yasyAhaM zirazchinnavAn sa eva yohanayaM sa zmazAnAdudatiSThat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>pUrvvaM svabhrAtuH philipasya patnyA udvAhaM kRtavantaM herodaM yohanavAdIt svabhAtRvadhU rna vivAhyA|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>ataH kAraNAt herod lokaM prahitya yohanaM dhRtvA bandhanAlaye baddhavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>herodiyA tasmai yohane prakupya taM hantum aicchat kintu na zaktA,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>yasmAd herod taM dhArmmikaM satpuruSaJca jJAtvA sammanya rakSitavAn; tatkathAM zrutvA tadanusAreNa bahUni karmmANi kRtavAn hRSTamanAstadupadezaM zrutavAMzca|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>kintu herod yadA svajanmadine pradhAnalokebhyaH senAnIbhyazca gAlIlpradezIyazreSThalokebhyazca rAtrau bhojyamekaM kRtavAn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>tasmin zubhadine herodiyAyAH kanyA sametya teSAM samakSaM saMnRtya herodastena sahopaviSTAnAJca toSamajIjanat tatA nRpaH kanyAmAha sma matto yad yAcase tadeva tubhyaM dAsye|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>zapathaM kRtvAkathayat ced rAjyArddhamapi yAcase tadapi tubhyaM dAsye|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>tataH sA bahi rgatvA svamAtaraM papraccha kimahaM yAciSye? tadA sAkathayat yohano majjakasya ziraH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>atha tUrNaM bhUpasamIpam etya yAcamAnAvadat kSaNesmin yohano majjakasya ziraH pAtre nidhAya dehi, etad yAce'haM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>tasmAt bhUpo'tiduHkhitaH, tathApi svazapathasya sahabhojinAJcAnurodhAt tadanaGgIkarttuM na zaktaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>tatkSaNaM rAjA ghAtakaM preSya tasya zira AnetumAdiSTavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>tataH sa kArAgAraM gatvA tacchirazchitvA pAtre nidhAyAnIya tasyai kanyAyai dattavAn kanyA ca svamAtre dadau|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>ananataraM yohanaH ziSyAstadvArttAM prApyAgatya tasya kuNapaM zmazAne'sthApayan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>atha preSitA yIzoH sannidhau militA yad yac cakruH zikSayAmAsuzca tatsarvvavArttAstasmai kathitavantaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>sa tAnuvAca yUyaM vijanasthAnaM gatvA vizrAmyata yatastatsannidhau bahulokAnAM samAgamAt te bhoktuM nAvakAzaM prAptAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>tataste nAvA vijanasthAnaM guptaM gagmuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>tato lokanivahasteSAM sthAnAntarayAnaM dadarza, aneke taM paricitya nAnApurebhyaH padairvrajitvA javena taiSAmagre yIzoH samIpa upatasthuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>tadA yIzu rnAvo bahirgatya lokAraNyAnIM dRSTvA teSu karuNAM kRtavAn yataste'rakSakameSA ivAsan tadA sa tAna nAnAprasaGgAn upadiSTavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>atha divAnte sati ziSyA etya yIzumUcire, idaM vijanasthAnaM dinaJcAvasannaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>lokAnAM kimapi khAdyaM nAsti, atazcaturdikSu grAmAn gantuM bhojyadravyANi kretuJca bhavAn tAn visRjatu|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>tadA sa tAnuvAca yUyameva tAn bhojayata; tataste jagadu rvayaM gatvA dvizatasaMkhyakai rmudrApAdaiH pUpAn krItvA kiM tAn bhojayiSyAmaH?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>tadA sa tAn pRSThavAn yuSmAkaM sannidhau kati pUpA Asate? gatvA pazyata; tataste dRSTvA tamavadan paJca pUpA dvau matsyau ca santi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>tadA sa lokAn zaspopari paMktibhirupavezayitum AdiSTavAn,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>tataste zataM zataM janAH paJcAzat paJcAzajjanAzca paMktibhi rbhuvi samupavivizuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>atha sa tAn paJcapUpAn matsyadvayaJca dhRtvA svargaM pazyan IzvaraguNAn anvakIrttayat tAn pUpAn bhaMktvA lokebhyaH pariveSayituM ziSyebhyo dattavAn dvA matsyau ca vibhajya sarvvebhyo dattavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>tataH sarvve bhuktvAtRpyan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>anantaraM ziSyA avaziSTaiH pUpai rmatsyaizca pUrNAn dvadaza DallakAn jagRhuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>te bhoktAraH prAyaH paJca sahasrANi puruSA Asan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>atha sa lokAn visRjanneva nAvamAroDhuM svasmAdagre pAre baitsaidApuraM yAtuJca zSyiाn vADhamAdiSTavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>tadA sa sarvvAn visRjya prArthayituM parvvataM gataH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>tataH sandhyAyAM satyAM nauH sindhumadhya upasthitA kintu sa ekAkI sthale sthitaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>atha sammukhavAtavahanAt ziSyA nAvaM vAhayitvA parizrAntA iti jJAtvA sa nizAcaturthayAme sindhUpari padbhyAM vrajan teSAM samIpametya teSAmagre yAtum udyataH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>kintu ziSyAH sindhUpari taM vrajantaM dRSTvA bhUtamanumAya ruruvuH,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>yataH sarvve taM dRSTvA vyAkulitAH| ataeva yIzustatkSaNaM taiH sahAlapya kathitavAn, susthirA bhUta, ayamahaM mA bhaiSTa|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>atha naukAmAruhya tasmin teSAM sannidhiM gate vAto nivRttaH; tasmAtte manaHsu vismitA AzcaryyaM menire|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>yataste manasAM kAThinyAt tat pUpIyam AzcaryyaM karmma na viviktavantaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>atha te pAraM gatvA gineSaratpradezametya taTa upasthitAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>teSu naukAto bahirgateSu tatpradezIyA lokAstaM paricitya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>caturdikSu dhAvanto yatra yatra rogiNo narA Asan tAn sarvvAna khaTvopari nidhAya yatra kutracit tadvArttAM prApuH tat sthAnam Anetum Arebhire|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v"/>tathA yatra yatra grAme yatra yatra pure yatra yatra pallyAJca tena pravezaH kRtastadvartmamadhye lokAH pIDitAn sthApayitvA tasya celagranthimAtraM spraSTum teSAmarthe tadanujJAM prArthayantaH yAvanto lokAH paspRzustAvanta eva gadAnmuktAH|</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>anantaraM yirUzAlama AgatAH phirUzino'dhyApakAzca yIzoH samIpam AgatAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>te tasya kiyataH ziSyAn azucikarairarthAda aprakSAlitahastai rbhuJjato dRSTvA tAnadUSayan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>yataH phirUzinaH sarvvayihUdIyAzca prAcAM paramparAgatavAkyaM sammanya pratalena hastAn aprakSAlya na bhuJjate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>ApanAdAgatya majjanaM vinA na khAdanti; tathA pAnapAtrANAM jalapAtrANAM pittalapAtrANAm AsanAnAJca jale majjanam ityAdayonyepi bahavasteSAmAcArAH santi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>te phirUzino'dhyApakAzca yIzuM papracchuH, tava ziSyAH prAcAM paramparAgatavAkyAnusAreNa nAcaranto'prakSAlitakaraiH kuto bhujaMte?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>tataH sa pratyuvAca kapaTino yuSmAn uddizya yizayiyabhaviSyadvAdI yuktamavAdIt| yathA svakIyairadharairete sammanyanate sadaiva mAM| kintu matto viprakarSe santi teSAM manAMsi ca|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>zikSayanto bidhIn nnAjJA bhajante mAM mudhaiva te|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>yUyaM jalapAtrapAnapAtrAdIni majjayanto manujaparamparAgatavAkyaM rakSatha kintu IzvarAjJAM laMghadhve; aparA IdRzyonekAH kriyA api kurudhve|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>anyaJcAkathayat yUyaM svaparamparAgatavAkyasya rakSArthaM spaSTarUpeNa IzvarAjJAM lopayatha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>yato mUsAdvArA proktamasti svapitarau sammanyadhvaM yastu mAtaraM pitaraM vA durvvAkyaM vakti sa nitAntaM hanyatAM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>kintu madIyena yena dravyeNa tavopakArobhavat tat karbbANamarthAd IzvarAya niveditam idaM vAkyaM yadi kopi pitaraM mAtaraM vA vakti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>tarhi yUyaM mAtuH pitu rvopakAraM karttAM taM vArayatha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>itthaM svapracAritaparamparAgatavAkyena yUyam IzvarAjJAM mudhA vidhadvve, IdRzAnyanyAnyanekAni karmmANi kurudhve|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>atha sa lokAnAhUya babhASe yUyaM sarvve madvAkyaM zRNuta budhyadhvaJca|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>bAhyAdantaraM pravizya naramamedhyaM karttAM zaknoti IdRzaM kimapi vastu nAsti, varam antarAd bahirgataM yadvastu tanmanujam amedhyaM karoti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>yasya zrotuM zrotre staH sa zRNotu|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>tataH sa lokAn hitvA gRhamadhyaM praviSTastadA ziSyAstadRSTAntavAkyArthaM papracchuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>tasmAt sa tAn jagAda yUyamapi kimetAdRgabodhAH? kimapi dravyaM bAhyAdantaraM pravizya naramamedhyaM karttAM na zaknoti kathAmimAM kiM na budhyadhve?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>tat tadantarna pravizati kintu kukSimadhyaM pravizati zeSe sarvvabhuktavastugrAhiNi bahirdeze niryAti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>aparamapyavAdId yannarAnnireti tadeva naramamedhyaM karoti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>yato'ntarAd arthAn mAnavAnAM manobhyaH kucintA parastrIvezyAgamanaM</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>naravadhazcauryyaM lobho duSTatA pravaJcanA kAmukatA kudRSTirIzvaranindA garvvastama ityAdIni nirgacchanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>etAni sarvvANi duritAnyantarAdetya naramamedhyaM kurvvanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>atha sa utthAya tatsthAnAt sorasIdonpurapradezaM jagAma tatra kimapi nivezanaM pravizya sarvvairajJAtaH sthAtuM matiJcakre kintu guptaH sthAtuM na zazAka|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>yataH suraphainikIdezIyayUnAnIvaMzodbhavastriyAH kanyA bhUtagrastAsIt| sA strI tadvArttAM prApya tatsamIpamAgatya taccaraNayoH patitvA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>svakanyAto bhUtaM nirAkarttAM tasmin vinayaM kRtavatI|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>kintu yIzustAmavadat prathamaM bAlakAstRpyantu yato bAlakAnAM khAdyaM gRhItvA kukkurebhyo nikSepo'nucitaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>tadA sA strI tamavAdIt bhoH prabho tat satyaM tathApi maJcAdhaHsthAH kukkurA bAlAnAM karapatitAni khAdyakhaNDAni khAdanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>tataH so'kathayad etatkathAhetoH sakuzalA yAhi tava kanyAM tyaktvA bhUto gataH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>atha sA strI gRhaM gatvA kanyAM bhUtatyaktAM zayyAsthitAM dadarza|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>punazca sa sorasIdonpurapradezAt prasthAya dikApalidezasya prAntarabhAgena gAlIljaladheH samIpaM gatavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>tadA lokairekaM badhiraM kadvadaJca naraM tannikaTamAnIya tasya gAtre hastamarpayituM vinayaH kRtaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>tato yIzu rlokAraNyAt taM nirjanamAnIya tasya karNayoGgulI rdadau niSThIvaM dattvA ca tajjihvAM pasparza|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>anantaraM svargaM nirIkSya dIrghaM nizvasya tamavadat itaphataH arthAn mukto bhUyAt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>tatastatkSaNaM tasya karNau muktau jihvAyAzca jADyApagamAt sa suspaSTavAkyamakathayat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>atha sa tAn vADhamityAdideza yUyamimAM kathAM kasmaicidapi mA kathayata, kintu sa yati nyaSedhat te tati bAhulyena prAcArayan;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>te'ticamatkRtya parasparaM kathayAmAsuH sa badhirAya zravaNazaktiM mUkAya ca kathanazaktiM dattvA sarvvaM karmmottamarUpeNa cakAra|</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>tadA tatsamIpaM bahavo lokA AyAtA atasteSAM bhojyadravyAbhAvAd yIzuH ziSyAnAhUya jagAda,|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>lokanivahe mama kRpA jAyate te dinatrayaM mayA sArddhaM santi teSAM bhojyaM kimapi nAsti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>teSAM madhye'neke dUrAd AgatAH, abhukteSu teSu mayA svagRhamabhiprahiteSu te pathi klamiSyanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>ziSyA avAdiSuH, etAvato lokAn tarpayitum atra prantare pUpAn prAptuM kena zakyate?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>tataH sa tAn papraccha yuSmAkaM kati pUpAH santi? te'kathayan sapta|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>tataH sa tAllokAn bhuvi samupaveSTum Adizya tAn sapta pUpAn dhRtvA IzvaraguNAn anukIrttayAmAsa, bhaMktvA pariveSayituM ziSyAn prati dadau, tataste lokebhyaH pariveSayAmAsuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>tathA teSAM samIpe ye kSudramatsyA Asan tAnapyAdAya IzvaraguNAn saMkIrtya pariveSayitum AdiSTavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>tato lokA bhuktvA tRptiM gatA avaziSTakhAdyaiH pUrNAH saptaDallakA gRhItAzca|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>ete bhoktAraH prAyazcatuH sahasrapuruSA Asan tataH sa tAn visasarja|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>atha sa ziSyaH saha nAvamAruhya dalmAnUthAsImAmAgataH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>tataH paraM phirUzina Agatya tena saha vivadamAnAstasya parIkSArtham AkAzIyacihnaM draSTuM yAcitavantaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>tadA so'ntardIrghaM nizvasyAkathayat, ete vidyamAnanarAH kutazcinhaM mRgayante? yuSmAnahaM yathArthaM bravImi lokAnetAn kimapi cihnaM na darzayiSyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>atha tAn hitvA puna rnAvam Aruhya pAramagAt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>etarhi ziSyaiH pUpeSu vismRteSu nAvi teSAM sannidhau pUpa ekaeva sthitaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>tadAnIM yIzustAn AdiSTavAn phirUzinAM herodazca kiNvaM prati satarkAH sAvadhAnAzca bhavata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>tataste'nyonyaM vivecanaM kartum Arebhire, asmAkaM sannidhau pUpo nAstIti hetoridaM kathayati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>tad budvvA yIzustebhyo'kathayat yuSmAkaM sthAne pUpAbhAvAt kuta itthaM vitarkayatha? yUyaM kimadyApi kimapi na jAnItha? boddhuJca na zaknutha? yAvadadya kiM yuSmAkaM manAMsi kaThinAni santi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>satsu netreSu kiM na pazyatha? satsu karNeSu kiM na zRNutha? na smaratha ca?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>yadAhaM paJcapUpAn paJcasahasrANAM puruSANAM madhye bhaMktvA dattavAn tadAnIM yUyam avaziSTapUpaiH pUrNAn kati DallakAn gRhItavantaH? te'kathayan dvAdazaDallakAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>aparaJca yadA catuHsahasrANAM puruSANAM madhye pUpAn bhaMktvAdadAM tadA yUyam atiriktapUpAnAM kati DallakAn gRhItavantaH? te kathayAmAsuH saptaDallakAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>tadA sa kathitavAn tarhi yUyam adhunApi kuto bodvvuM na zaknutha?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>anantaraM tasmin baitsaidAnagare prApte lokA andhamekaM naraM tatsamIpamAnIya taM spraSTuM taM prArthayAJcakrire|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>tadA tasyAndhasya karau gRhItvA nagarAd bahirdezaM taM nItavAn; tannetre niSThIvaM dattvA tadgAtre hastAvarpayitvA taM papraccha, kimapi pazyasi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>sa netre unmIlya jagAda, vRkSavat manujAn gacchato nirIkSe|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>tato yIzuH punastasya nayanayo rhastAvarpayitvA tasya netre unmIlayAmAsa; tasmAt sa svastho bhUtvA spaSTarUpaM sarvvalokAn dadarza|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>tataH paraM tvaM grAmaM mA gaccha grAmasthaM kamapi ca kimapyanuktvA nijagRhaM yAhItyAdizya yIzustaM nijagRhaM prahitavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>anantaraM ziSyaiH sahito yIzuH kaisarIyAphilipipuraM jagAma, pathi gacchan tAnapRcchat ko'ham atra lokAH kiM vadanti?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>te pratyUcuH tvAM yohanaM majjakaM vadanti kintu kepi kepi eliyaM vadanti; apare kepi kepi bhaviSyadvAdinAm eko jana iti vadanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>atha sa tAnapRcchat kintu koham? ityatra yUyaM kiM vadatha? tadA pitaraH pratyavadat bhavAn abhiSiktastrAtA|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>tataH sa tAn gADhamAdizad yUyaM mama kathA kasmaicidapi mA kathayata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>manuSyaputreNAvazyaM bahavo yAtanA bhoktavyAH prAcInalokaiH pradhAnayAjakairadhyApakaizca sa ninditaH san ghAtayiSyate tRtIyadine utthAsyati ca, yIzuH ziSyAnupadeSTumArabhya kathAmimAM spaSTamAcaSTa|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>tasmAt pitarastasya hastau dhRtvA taM tarjjitavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>kintu sa mukhaM parAvartya ziSyagaNaM nirIkSya pitaraM tarjayitvAvAdId dUrIbhava vighnakArin IzvarIyakAryyAdapi manuSyakAryyaM tubhyaM rocatatarAM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>atha sa lokAn ziSyAMzcAhUya jagAda yaH kazcin mAmanugantum icchati sa AtmAnaM dAmyatu, svakruzaM gRhItvA matpazcAd AyAtu|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>yato yaH kazcit svaprANaM rakSitumicchati sa taM hArayiSyati, kintu yaH kazcin madarthaM susaMvAdArthaJca prANaM hArayati sa taM rakSiSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>aparaJca manujaH sarvvaM jagat prApya yadi svaprANaM hArayati tarhi tasya ko lAbhaH?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>naraH svaprANavinimayena kiM dAtuM zaknoti?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>eteSAM vyabhicAriNAM pApinAJca lokAnAM sAkSAd yadi kopi mAM matkathAJca lajjAspadaM jAnAti tarhi manujaputro yadA dharmmadUtaiH saha pituH prabhAveNAgamiSyati tadA sopi taM lajjAspadaM jJAsyati|</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>atha sa tAnavAdIt yuSmabhyamahaM yathArthaM kathayAmi, IzvararAjyaM parAkrameNopasthitaM na dRSTvA mRtyuM nAsvAdiSyante, atra daNDAyamAnAnAM madhyepi tAdRzA lokAH santi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>atha SaDdinebhyaH paraM yIzuH pitaraM yAkUbaM yohanaJca gRhItvA gireruccasya nirjanasthAnaM gatvA teSAM pratyakSe mUrtyantaraM dadhAra|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>tatastasya paridheyam IdRzam ujjvalahimapANaDaraM jAtaM yad jagati kopi rajako na tAdRk pANaDaraM karttAM zaknoti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>aparaJca eliyo mUsAzca tebhyo darzanaM dattvA yIzunA saha kathanaM karttumArebhAte|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>tadA pitaro yIzumavAdIt he guro'smAkamatra sthitiruttamA, tataeva vayaM tvatkRte ekAM mUsAkRte ekAm eliyakRte caikAM, etAstisraH kuTI rnirmmAma|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>kintu sa yaduktavAn tat svayaM na bubudhe tataH sarvve bibhayAJcakruH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>etarhi payodastAn chAdayAmAsa, mamayAM priyaH putraH kathAsu tasya manAMsi nivezayateti nabhovANI tanmedyAnniryayau|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>atha haThAtte caturdizo dRSTvA yIzuM vinA svaiH sahitaM kamapi na dadRzuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>tataH paraM gireravarohaNakAle sa tAn gADham dUtyAdideza yAvannarasUnoH zmazAnAdutthAnaM na bhavati, tAvat darzanasyAsya vArttA yuSmAbhiH kasmaicidapi na vaktavyA|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>tadA zmazAnAdutthAnasya kobhiprAya iti vicAryya te tadvAkyaM sveSu gopAyAJcakrire|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>atha te yIzuM papracchuH prathamata eliyenAgantavyam iti vAkyaM kuta upAdhyAyA AhuH?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>tadA sa pratyuvAca , eliyaH prathamametya sarvvakAryyANi sAdhayiSyati; naraputre ca lipi ryathAste tathaiva sopi bahuduHkhaM prApyAvajJAsyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>kintvahaM yuSmAn vadAmi , eliyArthe lipi ryathAste tathaiva sa etya yayau, lokA: svecchAnurUpaM tamabhivyavaharanti sma|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>anantaraM sa ziSyasamIpametya teSAM catuHpArzve taiH saha bahujanAn vivadamAnAn adhyApakAMzca dRSTavAn;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>kintu sarvvalokAstaM dRSTvaiva camatkRtya tadAsannaM dhAvantastaM praNemuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>tadA yIzuradhyApakAnaprAkSId etaiH saha yUyaM kiM vivadadhve?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>tato lokAnAM kazcidekaH pratyavAdIt he guro mama sUnuM mUkaM bhUtadhRtaJca bhavadAsannam AnayaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>yadAsau bhUtastamAkramate tadaiva pAtasati tathA sa pheNAyate, dantairdantAn gharSati kSINo bhavati ca; tato hetostaM bhUtaM tyAjayituM bhavacchiSyAn niveditavAn kintu te na zekuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>tadA sa tamavAdIt, re avizvAsinaH santAnA yuSmAbhiH saha kati kAlAnahaM sthAsyAmi? aparAn kati kAlAn vA va AcArAn sahiSye? taM madAsannamAnayata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>tatastatsannidhiM sa AnIyata kintu taM dRSTvaiva bhUto bAlakaM dhRtavAn; sa ca bhUmau patitvA pheNAyamAno luloTha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>tadA sa tatpitaraM papraccha, asyedRzI dazA kati dinAni bhUtA? tataH sovAdIt bAlyakAlAt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>bhUtoyaM taM nAzayituM bahuvArAn vahnau jale ca nyakSipat kintu yadi bhavAna kimapi karttAM zaknoti tarhi dayAM kRtvAsmAn upakarotu|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>tadA yIzustamavadat yadi pratyetuM zaknoSi tarhi pratyayine janAya sarvvaM sAdhyam|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>tatastatkSaNaM tadbAlakasya pitA proccai rUvan sAzrunetraH provAca, prabho pratyemi mamApratyayaM pratikuru|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>atha yIzu rlokasaGghaM dhAvitvAyAntaM dRSTvA tamapUtabhUtaM tarjayitvA jagAda, re badhira mUka bhUta tvametasmAd bahirbhava punaH kadApi mAzrayainaM tvAmaham ityAdizAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>tadA sa bhUtazcItzabdaM kRtvA tamApIDya bahirjajAma, tato bAlako mRtakalpo babhUva tasmAdayaM mRta_ityaneke kathayAmAsuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>kintu karaM dhRtvA yIzunotthApitaH sa uttasthau|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>atha yIzau gRhaM praviSTe ziSyA guptaM taM papracchuH, vayamenaM bhUtaM tyAjayituM kuto na zaktAH?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>sa uvAca, prArthanopavAsau vinA kenApyanyena karmmaNA bhUtamIdRzaM tyAjayituM na zakyaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>anantaraM sa tatsthAnAditvA gAlIlmadhyena yayau, kintu tat kopi jAnIyAditi sa naicchat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>aparaJca sa ziSyAnupadizan babhASe, naraputro narahasteSu samarpayiSyate te ca taM haniSyanti taistasmin hate tRtIyadine sa utthAsyatIti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>kintu tatkathAM te nAbudhyanta praSTuJca bibhyaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>atha yIzuH kapharnAhUmpuramAgatya madhyegRhaJcetya tAnapRcchad vartmamadhye yUyamanyonyaM kiM vivadadhve sma?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>kintu te niruttarAstasthu ryasmAtteSAM ko mukhya iti vartmAni te'nyonyaM vyavadanta|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>tataH sa upavizya dvAdazaziSyAn AhUya babhASe yaH kazcit mukhyo bhavitumicchati sa sarvvebhyo gauNaH sarvveSAM sevakazca bhavatu|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>tadA sa bAlakamekaM gRhItvA madhye samupAvezayat tatastaM kroDe kRtvA tAnavAdAt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>yaH kazcidIdRzasya kasyApi bAlasyAtithyaM karoti sa mamAtithyaM karoti; yaH kazcinmamAtithyaM karoti sa kevalam mamAtithyaM karoti tanna matprerakasyApyAtithyaM karoti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>atha yohan tamabravIt he guro, asmAkamananugAminam ekaM tvAnnAmnA bhUtAn tyAjayantaM vayaM dRSTavantaH, asmAkamapazcAdgAmitvAcca taM nyaSedhAma|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>kintu yIzuravadat taM mA niSedhat, yato yaH kazcin mannAmnA citraM karmma karoti sa sahasA mAM nindituM na zaknoti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>tathA yaH kazcid yuSmAkaM vipakSatAM na karoti sa yuSmAkameva sapakSaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>yaH kazcid yuSmAn khrISTaziSyAn jJAtvA mannAmnA kaMsaikena pAnIyaM pAtuM dadAti, yuSmAnahaM yathArthaM vacmi, sa phalena vaJcito na bhaviSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>kintu yadi kazcin mayi vizvAsinAmeSAM kSudraprANinAm ekasyApi vighnaM janayati, tarhi tasyaitatkarmma karaNAt kaNThabaddhapeSaNIkasya tasya sAgarAgAdhajala majjanaM bhadraM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>ataH svakaro yadi tvAM bAdhate tarhi taM chindhi;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>yasmAt yatra kITA na mriyante vahnizca na nirvvAti, tasmin anirvvANAnalanarake karadvayavastava gamanAt karahInasya svargapravezastava kSemaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>yadi tava pAdo vighnaM janayati tarhi taM chindhi,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>yato yatra kITA na mriyante vahnizca na nirvvAti, tasmin 'nirvvANavahnau narake dvipAdavatastava nikSepAt pAdahInasya svargapravezastava kSemaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>svanetraM yadi tvAM bAdhate tarhi tadapyutpATaya, yato yatra kITA na mriyante vahnizca na nirvvAti,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>tasmina 'nirvvANavahnau narake dvinetrasya tava nikSepAd ekanetravata IzvararAjye pravezastava kSemaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>yathA sarvvo bali rlavaNAktaH kriyate tathA sarvvo jano vahnirUpeNa lavaNAktaH kAriSyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>lavaNaM bhadraM kintu yadi lavaNe svAdutA na tiSThati, tarhi katham AsvAdyuktaM kariSyatha? yUyaM lavaNayuktA bhavata parasparaM prema kuruta|</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>anantaraM sa tatsthAnAt prasthAya yarddananadyAH pAre yihUdApradeza upasthitavAn, tatra tadantike lokAnAM samAgame jAte sa nijarItyanusAreNa punastAn upadideza|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>tadA phirUzinastatsamIpam etya taM parIkSituM papracchaH svajAyA manujAnAM tyajyA na veti?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>tataH sa pratyavAdIt, atra kAryye mUsA yuSmAn prati kimAjJApayat?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>ta UcuH tyAgapatraM lekhituM svapatnIM tyaktuJca mUsA'numanyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>tadA yIzuH pratyuvAca, yuSmAkaM manasAM kAThinyAddheto rmUsA nidezamimam alikhat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>kintu sRSTerAdau Izvaro narAn puMrUpeNa strIrUpeNa ca sasarja|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>"tataH kAraNAt pumAn pitaraM mAtaraJca tyaktvA svajAyAyAm Asakto bhaviSyati,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>tau dvAv ekAGgau bhaviSyataH|" tasmAt tatkAlamArabhya tau na dvAv ekAGgau|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>ataH kAraNAd Izvaro yadayojayat kopi narastanna viyejayet|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>atha yIzu rgRhaM praviSTastadA ziSyAH punastatkathAM taM papracchuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>tataH sovadat kazcid yadi svabhAryyAM tyaktavAnyAm udvahati tarhi sa svabhAryyAyAH prAtikUlyena vyabhicArI bhavati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>kAcinnArI yadi svapatiM hitvAnyapuMsA vivAhitA bhavati tarhi sApi vyabhicAriNI bhavati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>atha sa yathA zizUn spRzet, tadarthaM lokaistadantikaM zizava AnIyanta, kintu ziSyAstAnAnItavatastarjayAmAsuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>yIzustad dRSTvA krudhyan jagAda, mannikaTam AgantuM zizUn mA vArayata, yata etAdRzA IzvararAjyAdhikAriNaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>yuSmAnahaM yathArthaM vacmi, yaH kazcit zizuvad bhUtvA rAjyamIzvarasya na gRhlIyAt sa kadApi tadrAjyaM praveSTuM na zaknoti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>ananataraM sa zizUnaGke nidhAya teSAM gAtreSu hastau dattvAziSaM babhASe|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>atha sa vartmanA yAti, etarhi jana eko dhAvan Agatya tatsammukhe jAnunI pAtayitvA pRSTavAn, bhoH paramaguro, anantAyuH prAptaye mayA kiM karttavyaM?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>tadA yIzuruvAca, mAM paramaM kuto vadasi? vinezvaraM kopi paramo na bhavati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>parastrIM nAbhigaccha; naraM mA ghAtaya; steyaM mA kuru; mRSAsAkSyaM mA dehi; hiMsAJca mA kuru; pitarau sammanyasva; nidezA ete tvayA jJAtAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>tatastana pratyuktaM, he guro bAlyakAlAdahaM sarvvAnetAn AcarAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>tadA yIzustaM vilokya snehena babhASe, tavaikasyAbhAva Aste; tvaM gatvA sarvvasvaM vikrIya daridrebhyo vizrANaya, tataH svarge dhanaM prApsyasi; tataH param etya kruzaM vahan madanuvarttI bhava|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>kintu tasya bahusampadvidyamAnatvAt sa imAM kathAmAkarNya viSaNo duHkhitazca san jagAma|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>atha yIzuzcaturdizo nirIkSya ziSyAn avAdIt, dhanilokAnAm IzvararAjyapravezaH kIdRg duSkaraH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>tasya kathAtaH ziSyAzcamaccakruH, kintu sa punaravadat, he bAlakA ye dhane vizvasanti teSAm IzvararAjyapravezaH kIdRg duSkaraH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>IzvararAjye dhaninAM pravezAt sUcirandhreNa mahAGgasya gamanAgamanaM sukaraM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>tadA ziSyA atIva vismitAH parasparaM procuH, tarhi kaH paritrANaM prAptuM zaknoti?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>tato yIzustAn vilokya babhASe, tan narasyAsAdhyaM kintu nezvarasya, yato hetorIzvarasya sarvvaM sAdhyam|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>tadA pitara uvAca, pazya vayaM sarvvaM parityajya bhavatonugAmino jAtAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>tato yIzuH pratyavadat, yuSmAnahaM yathArthaM vadAmi, madarthaM susaMvAdArthaM vA yo janaH sadanaM bhrAtaraM bhaginIM pitaraM mAtaraM jAyAM santAnAn bhUmi vA tyaktvA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>gRhabhrAtRbhaginIpitRmAtRpatnIsantAnabhUmInAmiha zataguNAn pretyAnantAyuzca na prApnoti tAdRzaH kopi nAsti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>kintvagrIyA aneke lokAH zeSAH, zeSIyA aneke lokAzcAgrA bhaviSyanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>atha yirUzAlamyAnakAle yIzusteSAm agragAmI babhUva, tasmAtte citraM jJAtvA pazcAdgAmino bhUtvA bibhyuH| tadA sa puna rdvAdazaziSyAn gRhItvA svIyaM yadyad ghaTiSyate tattat tebhyaH kathayituM prArebhe;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>pazyata vayaM yirUzAlampuraM yAmaH, tatra manuSyaputraH pradhAnayAjakAnAm upAdhyAyAnAJca kareSu samarpayiSyate; te ca vadhadaNDAjJAM dApayitvA paradezIyAnAM kareSu taM samarpayiSyanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>te tamupahasya kazayA prahRtya tadvapuSi niSThIvaM nikSipya taM haniSyanti, tataH sa tRtIyadine protthAsyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>tataH sivadeH putrau yAkUbyohanau tadantikam etya procatuH, he guro yad AvAbhyAM yAciSyate tadasmadarthaM bhavAn karotu nivedanamidamAvayoH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>tataH sa kathitavAn, yuvAM kimicchathaH? kiM mayA yuSmadarthaM karaNIyaM?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>tadA tau procatuH, AvayorekaM dakSiNapArzve vAmapArzve caikaM tavaizvaryyapade samupaveSTum AjJApaya|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>kintu yIzuH pratyuvAca yuvAmajJAtvedaM prArthayethe, yena kaMsenAhaM pAsyAmi tena yuvAbhyAM kiM pAtuM zakSyate? yasmin majjanenAhaM majjiSye tanmajjane majjayituM kiM yuvAbhyAM zakSyate? tau pratyUcatuH zakSyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>tadA yIzuravadat yena kaMsenAhaM pAsyAmi tenAvazyaM yuvAmapi pAsyathaH, yena majjanena cAhaM majjiyye tatra yuvAmapi majjiSyethe|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>kintu yeSAmartham idaM nirUpitaM, tAn vihAyAnyaM kamapi mama dakSiNapArzve vAmapArzve vA samupavezayituM mamAdhikAro nAsti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>athAnyadazaziSyA imAM kathAM zrutvA yAkUbyohanbhyAM cukupuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>kintu yIzustAn samAhUya babhASe, anyadezIyAnAM rAjatvaM ye kurvvanti te teSAmeva prabhutvaM kurvvanti, tathA ye mahAlokAste teSAm adhipatitvaM kurvvantIti yUyaM jAnItha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>kintu yuSmAkaM madhye na tathA bhaviSyati, yuSmAkaM madhye yaH prAdhAnyaM vAJchati sa yuSmAkaM sevako bhaviSyati,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>yuSmAkaM yo mahAn bhavitumicchati sa sarvveSAM kiGkaro bhaviSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>yato manuSyaputraH sevyo bhavituM nAgataH sevAM karttAM tathAnekeSAM paritrANasya mUlyarUpasvaprANaM dAtuJcAgataH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>atha te yirIhonagaraM prAptAstasmAt ziSyai rlokaizca saha yIzo rgamanakAle TImayasya putro barTImayanAmA andhastanmArgapArzve bhikSArtham upaviSTaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>sa nAsaratIyasya yIzorAgamanavArttAM prApya procai rvaktumArebhe, he yIzo dAyUdaH santAna mAM dayasva|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>tatoneke lokA maunIbhaveti taM tarjayAmAsuH, kintu sa punaradhikamuccai rjagAda, he yIzo dAyUdaH santAna mAM dayasva|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>tadA yIzuH sthitvA tamAhvAtuM samAdideza, tato lokAstamandhamAhUya babhASire, he nara, sthiro bhava, uttiSTha, sa tvAmAhvayati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>tadA sa uttarIyavastraM nikSipya protthAya yIzoH samIpaM gataH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>tato yIzustamavadat tvayA kiM prArthyate? tubhyamahaM kiM kariSyAmI? tadA sondhastamuvAca, he guro madIyA dRSTirbhavet|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>tato yIzustamuvAca yAhi tava vizvAsastvAM svasthamakArSIt, tasmAt tatkSaNaM sa dRSTiM prApya pathA yIzoH pazcAd yayau|</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>anantaraM teSu yirUzAlamaH samIpasthayo rbaitphagIbaithanIyapurayorantikasthaM jaitunanAmAdrimAgateSu yIzuH preSaNakAle dvau ziSyAvidaM vAkyaM jagAda,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>yuvAmamuM sammukhasthaM grAmaM yAtaM, tatra pravizya yo naraM nAvahat taM garddabhazAvakaM drakSyathastaM mocayitvAnayataM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>kintu yuvAM karmmedaM kutaH kuruthaH? kathAmimAM yadi kopi pRcchati tarhi prabhoratra prayojanamastIti kathite sa zIghraM tamatra preSayiSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>tatastau gatvA dvimArgamelane kasyacid dvArasya pArzve taM garddabhazAvakaM prApya mocayataH,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>etarhi tatropasthitalokAnAM kazcid apRcchat, garddabhazizuM kuto mocayathaH?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>tadA yIzorAjJAnusAreNa tebhyaH pratyudite tatkSaNaM tamAdAtuM te'nujajJuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>atha tau yIzoH sannidhiM garddabhazizum AnIya tadupari svavastrANi pAtayAmAsatuH; tataH sa tadupari samupaviSTaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>tadAneke pathi svavAsAMsi pAtayAmAsuH, paraizca taruzAkhAzchitavA mArge vikIrNAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>aparaJca pazcAdgAmino'gragAminazca sarvve janA ucaiHsvareNa vaktumArebhire, jaya jaya yaH paramezvarasya nAmnAgacchati sa dhanya iti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>tathAsmAkamaM pUrvvapuruSasya dAyUdo yadrAjyaM paramezvaranAmnAyAti tadapi dhanyaM, sarvvasmAducchrAye svarge Izvarasya jayo bhavet|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>itthaM yIzu ryirUzAlami mandiraM pravizya caturdiksthAni sarvvANi vastUni dRSTavAn; atha sAyaMkAla upasthite dvAdazaziSyasahito baithaniyaM jagAma|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>aparehani baithaniyAd Agamanasamaye kSudhArtto babhUva|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>tato dUre sapatramuDumbarapAdapaM vilokya tatra kiJcit phalaM prAptuM tasya sannikRSTaM yayau, tadAnIM phalapAtanasya samayo nAgacchati| tatastatropasthitaH patrANi vinA kimapyaparaM na prApya sa kathitavAn,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>adyArabhya kopi mAnavastvattaH phalaM na bhuJjIta; imAM kathAM tasya ziSyAH zuzruvuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>tadanantaraM teSu yirUzAlamamAyAteSu yIzu rmandiraM gatvA tatrasthAnAM baNijAM mudrAsanAni pArAvatavikretRNAm AsanAni ca nyubjayAJcakAra sarvvAn kretRn vikretRMzca bahizcakAra|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>aparaM mandiramadhyena kimapi pAtraM voDhuM sarvvajanaM nivArayAmAsa|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>lokAnupadizan jagAda, mama gRhaM sarvvajAtIyAnAM prArthanAgRham iti nAmnA prathitaM bhaviSyati etat kiM zAstre likhitaM nAsti? kintu yUyaM tadeva corANAM gahvaraM kurutha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>imAM vANIM zrutvAdhyApakAH pradhAnayAjakAzca taM yathA nAzayituM zaknuvanti tathoेpAyaM mRgayAmAsuH, kintu tasyopadezAt sarvve lokA vismayaM gatA ataste tasmAd bibhyuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>atha sAyaMsamaya upasthite yIzurnagarAd bahirvavrAja|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>anantaraM prAtaHkAle te tena mArgeNa gacchantastamuDumbaramahIruhaM samUlaM zuSkaM dadRzuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>tataH pitaraH pUrvvavAkyaM smaran yIzuM babhASaM, he guro pazyatu ya uDumbaraviTapI bhavatA zaptaH sa zuSko babhUva|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>tato yIzuH pratyavAdIt, yUyamIzvare vizvasita|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>yuSmAnahaM yathArthaM vadAmi kopi yadyetadgiriM vadati, tvamutthAya gatvA jaladhau pata, proktamidaM vAkyamavazyaM ghaTiSyate, manasA kimapi na sandihya cedidaM vizvaset tarhi tasya vAkyAnusAreNa tad ghaTiSyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>ato hetorahaM yuSmAn vacmi, prArthanAkAle yadyadAkAMkSiSyadhve tattadavazyaM prApsyatha, itthaM vizvasita, tataH prApsyatha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>aparaJca yuSmAsu prArthayituM samutthiteSu yadi kopi yuSmAkam aparAdhI tiSThati, tarhi taM kSamadhvaM, tathA kRte yuSmAkaM svargasthaH pitApi yuSmAkamAgAMmi kSamiSyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>kintu yadi na kSamadhve tarhi vaH svargasthaH pitApi yuSmAkamAgAMsi na kSamiSyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>anantaraM te puna ryirUzAlamaM pravivizuH, yIzu ryadA madhyemandiram itastato gacchati, tadAnIM pradhAnayAjakA upAdhyAyAH prAJcazca tadantikametya kathAmimAM papracchuH,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>tvaM kenAdezena karmmANyetAni karoSi? tathaitAni karmmANi karttAM kenAdiSTosi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>tato yIzuH pratigaditavAn ahamapi yuSmAn ekakathAM pRcchAmi, yadi yUyaM tasyA uttaraM kurutha, tarhi kayAjJayAhaM karmmANyetAni karomi tad yuSmabhyaM kathayiSyAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>yohano majjanam IzvarAt jAtaM kiM mAnavAt? tanmahyaM kathayata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>te parasparaM vivektuM prArebhire, tad IzvarAd babhUveti ced vadAmastarhi kutastaM na pratyaita? kathametAM kathayiSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>mAnavAd abhavaditi ced vadAmastarhi lokebhyo bhayamasti yato hetoH sarvve yohanaM satyaM bhaviSyadvAdinaM manyante|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>ataeva te yIzuM pratyavAdiSu rvayaM tad vaktuM na zaknumaH| yIzuruvAca, tarhi yenAdezena karmmANyetAni karomi, ahamapi yuSmabhyaM tanna kathayiSyAmi|</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>anantaraM yIzu rdRSTAntena tebhyaH kathayitumArebhe, kazcideko drAkSAkSetraM vidhAya taccaturdikSu vAraNIM kRtvA tanmadhye drAkSApeSaNakuNDam akhanat, tathA tasya gaDamapi nirmmitavAn tatastatkSetraM kRSIvaleSu samarpya dUradezaM jagAma|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>tadanantaraM phalakAle kRSIvalebhyo drAkSAkSetraphalAni prAptuM teSAM savidhe bhRtyam ekaM prAhiNot|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>kintu kRSIvalAstaM dhRtvA prahRtya riktahastaM visasRjuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>tataH sa punaranyamekaM bhRtyaM praSayAmAsa, kintu te kRSIvalAH pASANAghAtaistasya ziro bhaGktvA sApamAnaM taM vyasarjan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>tataH paraM soparaM dAsaM prAhiNot tadA te taM jaghnuH, evam anekeSAM kasyacit prahAraH kasyacid vadhazca taiH kRtaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>tataH paraM mayA svaputre prahite te tamavazyaM sammaMsyante, ityuktvAvazeSe teSAM sannidhau nijapriyam advitIyaM putraM preSayAmAsa|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>kintu kRSIvalAH parasparaM jagaduH, eSa uttarAdhikArI, Agacchata vayamenaM hanmastathA kRte 'dhikAroyam asmAkaM bhaviSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>tatastaM dhRtvA hatvA drAkSAkSetrAd bahiH prAkSipan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>anenAsau drAkSAkSetrapatiH kiM kariSyati? sa etya tAn kRSIvalAn saMhatya tatkSetram anyeSu kRSIvaleSu samarpayiSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>aparaJca, "sthapatayaH kariSyanti grAvANaM yantu tucchakaM| prAdhAnaprastaraH koNe sa eva saMbhaviSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>etat karmma parezasyAMdbhutaM no dRSTito bhavet||" imAM zAstrIyAM lipiM yUyaM kiM nApAThiSTa?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>tadAnIM sa tAnuddizya tAM dRSTAntakathAM kathitavAn, ta itthaM budvvA taM dharttAmudyatAH, kintu lokebhyo bibhyuH, tadanantaraM te taM vihAya vavrajuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>aparaJca te tasya vAkyadoSaM dharttAM katipayAn phirUzino herodIyAMzca lokAn tadantikaM preSayAmAsuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>ta Agatya tamavadan, he guro bhavAn tathyabhASI kasyApyanurodhaM na manyate, pakSapAtaJca na karoti, yathArthata IzvarIyaM mArgaM darzayati vayametat prajAnImaH, kaisarAya karo deyo na vAM? vayaM dAsyAmo na vA?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>kintu sa teSAM kapaTaM jJAtvA jagAda, kuto mAM parIkSadhve? ekaM mudrApAdaM samAnIya mAM darzayata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>tadA tairekasmin mudrApAde samAnIte sa tAn papraccha, atra likhitaM nAma mUrtti rvA kasya? te pratyUcuH, kaisarasya|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>tadA yIzuravadat tarhi kaisarasya dravyANi kaisarAya datta, Izvarasya dravyANi tu IzvarAya datta; tataste vismayaM menire|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>atha mRtAnAmutthAnaM ye na manyante te sidUkino yIzoH samIpamAgatya taM papracchuH;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>he guro kazcijjano yadi niHsantatiH san bhAryyAyAM satyAM mriyate tarhi tasya bhrAtA tasya bhAryyAM gRhItvA bhrAtu rvaMzotpattiM kariSyati, vyavasthAmimAM mUsA asmAn prati vyalikhat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>kintu kecit sapta bhrAtara Asan, tatasteSAM jyeSThabhrAtA vivahya niHsantatiH san amriyata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>tato dvitIyo bhrAtA tAM striyamagRhaNat kintu sopi niHsantatiH san amriyata; atha tRtIyopi bhrAtA tAdRzobhavat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>itthaM saptaiva bhrAtarastAM striyaM gRhItvA niHsantAnAH santo'mriyanta, sarvvazeSe sApi strI mriyate sma|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>atha mRtAnAmutthAnakAle yadA ta utthAsyanti tadA teSAM kasya bhAryyA sA bhaviSyati? yataste saptaiva tAM vyavahan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>tato yIzuH pratyuvAca zAstram IzvarazaktiJca yUyamajJAtvA kimabhrAmyata na?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>mRtalokAnAmutthAnaM sati te na vivahanti vAgdattA api na bhavanti, kintu svargIyadUtAnAM sadRzA bhavanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>punazca "aham ibrAhIma Izvara ishAka Izvaro yAkUbazcezvaraH" yAmimAM kathAM stambamadhye tiSThan Izvaro mUsAmavAdIt mRtAnAmutthAnArthe sA kathA mUsAlikhite pustake kiM yuSmAbhi rnApAThi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Izvaro jIvatAM prabhuH kintu mRtAnAM prabhu rna bhavati, tasmAddheto ryUyaM mahAbhrameNa tiSThatha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>etarhi ekodhyApaka etya teSAmitthaM vicAraM zuzrAva; yIzusteSAM vAkyasya saduttaraM dattavAn iti budvvA taM pRSTavAn sarvvAsAm AjJAnAM kA zreSThA? tato yIzuH pratyuvAca,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>"he isrAyellokA avadhatta, asmAkaM prabhuH paramezvara eka eva,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>yUyaM sarvvantaHkaraNaiH sarvvaprANaiH sarvvacittaiH sarvvazaktibhizca tasmin prabhau paramezvare prIyadhvaM," ityAjJA zreSThA|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>tathA "svaprativAsini svavat prema kurudhvaM," eSA yA dvitIyAjJA sA tAdRzI; etAbhyAM dvAbhyAm AjJAbhyAm anyA kApyAjJA zreSThA nAsti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>tadA sodhyApakastamavadat, he guro satyaM bhavAn yathArthaM proktavAn yata ekasmAd IzvarAd anyo dvitIya Izvaro nAsti;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>aparaM sarvvAntaHkaraNaiH sarvvaprANaiH sarvvacittaiH sarvvazaktibhizca Izvare premakaraNaM tathA svamIpavAsini svavat premakaraNaJca sarvvebhyo homabalidAnAdibhyaH zraSThaM bhavati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>tato yIzuH subuddheriva tasyedam uttaraM zrutvA taM bhASitavAn tvamIzvarasya rAjyAnna dUrosi|itaH paraM tena saha kasyApi vAkyasya vicAraM karttAM kasyApi pragalbhatA na jAtA|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>anantaraM madhyemandiram upadizan yIzurimaM praznaM cakAra, adhyApakA abhiSiktaM (tArakaM) kuto dAyUdaH santAnaM vadanti?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>svayaM dAyUd pavitrasyAtmana AvezenedaM kathayAmAsa| yathA| "mama prabhumidaM vAkyavadat paramezvaraH| tava zatrUnahaM yAvat pAdapIThaM karomi na| tAvat kAlaM madIye tvaM dakSapArzv upAviza|"</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>yadi dAyUd taM prabhUM vadati tarhi kathaM sa tasya santAno bhavitumarhati? itare lokAstatkathAM zrutvAnananduH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>tadAnIM sa tAnupadizya kathitavAn ye narA dIrghaparidheyAni haTTe vipanau ca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>lokakRtanamaskArAn bhajanagRhe pradhAnAsanAni bhojanakAle pradhAnasthAnAni ca kAGkSante;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>vidhavAnAM sarvvasvaM grasitvA chalAd dIrghakAlaM prArthayante tebhya upAdhyAyebhyaH sAvadhAnA bhavata; te'dhikatarAn daNDAn prApsyanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>tadanantaraM lokA bhANDAgAre mudrA yathA nikSipanti bhANDAgArasya sammukhe samupavizya yIzustadavaluloka; tadAnIM bahavo dhaninastasya madhye bahUni dhanAni nirakSipan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>pazcAd ekA daridrA vidhavA samAgatya dvipaNamUlyAM mudraikAM tatra nirakSipat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>tadA yIzuH ziSyAn AhUya kathitavAn yuSmAnahaM yathArthaM vadAmi ye ye bhANDAgAre'smina dhanAni niHkSipanti sma tebhyaH sarvvebhya iyaM vidhavA daridrAdhikam niHkSipati sma|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>yataste prabhUtadhanasya kiJcit nirakSipan kintu dIneyaM svadinayApanayogyaM kiJcidapi na sthApayitvA sarvvasvaM nirakSipat|</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>anantaraM mandirAd bahirgamanakAle tasya ziSyANAmekastaM vyAhRtavAn he guro pazyatu kIdRzAH pASANAH kIdRk ca nicayanaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>tadA yIzustam avadat tvaM kimetad bRhannicayanaM pazyasi? asyaikapASANopi dvitIyapASANopari na sthAsyati sarvve 'dhaHkSepsyante|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>atha yasmin kAle jaitungirau mandirasya sammukhe sa samupaviSTastasmin kAle pitaro yAkUb yohan Andriyazcaite taM rahasi papracchuH,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>etA ghaTanAH kadA bhaviSyanti? tathaitatsarvvAsAM siddhyupakramasya vA kiM cihnaM? tadasmabhyaM kathayatu bhavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>tato yAzustAn vaktumArebhe, kopi yathA yuSmAn na bhrAmayati tathAtra yUyaM sAvadhAnA bhavata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>yataH khrISTohamiti kathayitvA mama nAmnAneke samAgatya lokAnAM bhramaM janayiSyanti;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>kintu yUyaM raNasya vArttAM raNADambaraJca zrutvA mA vyAkulA bhavata, ghaTanA etA avazyammAvinyaH; kintvApAtato na yugAnto bhaviSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>dezasya vipakSatayA dezo rAjyasya vipakSatayA ca rAjyamutthAsyati, tathA sthAne sthAne bhUmikampo durbhikSaM mahAklezAzca samupasthAsyanti, sarvva ete duHkhasyArambhAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>kintu yUyam AtmArthe sAvadhAnAstiSThata, yato lokA rAjasabhAyAM yuSmAn samarpayiSyanti, tathA bhajanagRhe prahariSyanti; yUyaM madarthe dezAdhipAn bhUpAMzca prati sAkSyadAnAya teSAM sammukhe upasthApayiSyadhve|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>zeSIbhavanAt pUrvvaM sarvvAn dezIyAn prati susaMvAdaH pracArayiSyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>kintu yadA te yuSmAn dhRtvA samarpayiSyanti tadA yUyaM yadyad uttaraM dAsyatha, tadagra tasya vivecanaM mA kuruta tadarthaM kiJcidapi mA cintayata ca, tadAnIM yuSmAkaM manaHsu yadyad vAkyam upasthApayiSyate tadeva vadiSyatha, yato yUyaM na tadvaktAraH kintu pavitra AtmA tasya vaktA|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>tadA bhrAtA bhrAtaraM pitA putraM ghAtanArthaM parahasteSu samarpayiSyate, tathA patyAni mAtApitro rvipakSatayA tau ghAtayiSyanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>mama nAmahetoH sarvveSAM savidhe yUyaM jugupsitA bhaviSyatha, kintu yaH kazcit zeSaparyyantaM dhairyyam AlambiSyate saeva paritrAsyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>dAniyelbhaviSyadvAdinA proktaM sarvvanAzi jugupsitaJca vastu yadA tvayogyasthAne vidyamAnaM drakSatha (yo janaH paThati sa budhyatAM) tadA ye yihUdIyadeze tiSThanti te mahIdhraM prati palAyantAM;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>tathA yo naro gRhopari tiSThati sa gRhamadhyaM nAvarohatu, tathA kimapi vastu grahItuM madhyegRhaM na pravizatu;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>tathA ca yo naraH kSetre tiSThati sopi svavastraM grahItuM parAvRtya na vrajatu|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>tadAnIM garbbhavatInAM stanyadAtrINAJca yoSitAM durgati rbhaviSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>yuSmAkaM palAyanaM zItakAle yathA na bhavati tadarthaM prArthayadhvaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>yatastadA yAdRzI durghaTanA ghaTiSyate tAdRzI durghaTanA IzvarasRSTeH prathamamArabhyAdya yAvat kadApi na jAtA na janiSyate ca|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>aparaJca paramezvaro yadi tasya samayasya saMkSepaM na karoti tarhi kasyApi prANabhRto rakSA bhavituM na zakSyati, kintu yAn janAn manonItAn akarot teSAM svamanonItAnAM hetoH sa tadanehasaM saMkSepsyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>anyacca pazyata khrISTotra sthAne vA tatra sthAne vidyate, tasminkAle yadi kazcid yuSmAn etAdRzaM vAkyaM vyAharati, tarhi tasmin vAkye bhaiva vizvasita|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>yatoneke mithyAkhrISTA mithyAbhaviSyadvAdinazca samupasthAya bahUni cihnAnyadbhutAni karmmANi ca darzayiSyanti; tathA yadi sambhavati tarhi manonItalokAnAmapi mithyAmatiM janayiSyanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>pazyata ghaTanAtaH pUrvvaM sarvvakAryyasya vArttAM yuSmabhyamadAm, yUyaM sAvadhAnAstiSThata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>aparaJca tasya klezakAlasyAvyavahite parakAle bhAskaraH sAndhakAro bhaviSyati tathaiva candrazcandrikAM na dAsyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>nabhaHsthAni nakSatrANi patiSyanti, vyomamaNDalasthA grahAzca vicaliSyanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>tadAnIM mahAparAkrameNa mahaizvaryyeNa ca meghamAruhya samAyAntaM mAnavasutaM mAnavAH samIkSiSyante|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>anyacca sa nijadUtAn prahitya nabhobhUmyoH sImAM yAvad jagatazcaturdigbhyaH svamanonItalokAn saMgrahISyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>uDumbarataro rdRSTAntaM zikSadhvaM yadoDumbarasya taro rnavInAH zAkhA jAyante pallavAdIni ca rnigacchanti, tadA nidAghakAlaH savidho bhavatIti yUyaM jJAtuM zaknutha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>tadvad etA ghaTanA dRSTvA sa kAlo dvAryyupasthita iti jAnIta|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>yuSmAnahaM yathArthaM vadAmi, AdhunikalokAnAM gamanAt pUrvvaM tAni sarvvANi ghaTiSyante|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>dyAvApRthivyo rvicalitayoH satyo rmadIyA vANI na vicaliSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>aparaJca svargasthadUtagaNo vA putro vA tAtAdanyaH kopi taM divasaM taM daNDaM vA na jJApayati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>ataH sa samayaH kadA bhaviSyati, etajjJAnAbhAvAd yUyaM sAvadhAnAstiSThata, satarkAzca bhUtvA prArthayadhvaM;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>yadvat kazcit pumAn svanivezanAd dUradezaM prati yAtrAkaraNakAle dAseSu svakAryyasya bhAramarpayitvA sarvvAn sve sve karmmaNi niyojayati; aparaM dauvArikaM jAgarituM samAdizya yAti, tadvan naraputraH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>gRhapatiH sAyaMkAle nizIthe vA tRtIyayAme vA prAtaHkAle vA kadAgamiSyati tad yUyaM na jAnItha;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>sa haThAdAgatya yathA yuSmAn nidritAn na pazyati, tadarthaM jAgaritAstiSThata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>yuSmAnahaM yad vadAmi tadeva sarvvAn vadAmi, jAgaritAstiSThateti|</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>tadA nistArotsavakiNvahInapUpotsavayorArambhasya dinadvaye 'vaziSTe pradhAnayAjakA adhyApakAzca kenApi chalena yIzuM dharttAM hantuJca mRgayAJcakrire;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>kintu lokAnAM kalahabhayAdUcire, nacotsavakAla ucitametaditi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>anantaraM baithaniyApuुre zimonakuSThino gRhe yozau bhotkumupaviSTe sati kAcid yoSit pANDarapASANasya sampuTakena mahArghyottamatailam AnIya sampuTakaM bhaMktvA tasyottamAGge tailadhArAM pAtayAJcakre|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>tasmAt kecit svAnte kupyantaH kathitavaMntaH kutoyaM tailApavyayaH?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>yadyetat taila vyakreSyata tarhi mudrApAdazatatrayAdapyadhikaM tasya prAptamUlyaM daridralokebhyo dAtumazakSyata, kathAmetAM kathayitvA tayA yoSitA sAkaM vAcAyuhyan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>kintu yIzuruvAca, kuta etasyai kRcchraM dadAsi? mahyamiyaM karmmottamaM kRtavatI|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>daridrAH sarvvadA yuSmAbhiH saha tiSThanti, tasmAd yUyaM yadecchatha tadaiva tAnupakarttAM zaknutha, kintvahaM yubhAbhiH saha nirantaraM na tiSThAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>asyA yathAsAdhyaM tathaivAkarodiyaM, zmazAnayApanAt pUrvvaM sametya madvapuSi tailam amarddayat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>ahaM yuSmabhyaM yathArthaM kathayAmi, jagatAM madhye yatra yatra susaMvAdoyaM pracArayiSyate tatra tatra yoSita etasyAH smaraNArthaM tatkRtakarmmaitat pracArayiSyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>tataH paraM dvAdazAnAM ziSyANAmeka ISkariyotIyayihUdAkhyo yIzuM parakareSu samarpayituM pradhAnayAjakAnAM samIpamiyAya|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>te tasya vAkyaM samAkarNya santuSTAH santastasmai mudrA dAtuM pratyajAnata; tasmAt sa taM teSAM kareSu samarpaNAyopAyaM mRgayAmAsa|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>anantaraM kiNvazUnyapUpotsavasya prathame'hani nistArotmavArthaM meSamAraNAsamaye ziSyAstaM papracchaH kutra gatvA vayaM nistArotsavasya bhojyamAsAdayiSyAmaH? kimicchati bhavAn?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>tadAnIM sa teSAM dvayaM prerayan babhASe yuvayoH puramadhyaM gatayoH sato ryo janaH sajalakumbhaM vahan yuvAM sAkSAt kariSyati tasyaiva pazcAd yAtaM;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>sa yat sadanaM pravekSyati tadbhavanapatiM vadataM, gururAha yatra saziSyohaM nistArotsavIyaM bhojanaM kariSyAmi, sA bhojanazAlA kutrAsti?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>tataH sa pariSkRtAM susajjitAM bRhatIcaJca yAM zAlAM darzayiSyati tasyAmasmadarthaM bhojyadravyANyAsAdayataM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>tataH ziSyau prasthAya puraM pravizya sa yathoktavAn tathaiva prApya nistArotsavasya bhojyadravyANi samAsAdayetAm|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>anantaraM yIzuH sAyaMkAle dvAdazabhiH ziSyaiH sArddhaM jagAma;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>sarvveSu bhojanAya propaviSTeSu sa tAnuditavAn yuSmAnahaM yathArthaM vyAharAmi, atra yuSmAkameko jano yo mayA saha bhuMkte mAM parakereSu samarpayiSyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>tadAnIM te duHkhitAH santa ekaikazastaM praSTumArabdhavantaH sa kimahaM? pazcAd anya ekobhidadhe sa kimahaM?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>tataH sa pratyavadad eteSAM dvAdazAnAM yo jano mayA samaM bhojanApAtre pANiM majjayiSyati sa eva|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>manujatanayamadhi yAdRzaM likhitamAste tadanurUpA gatistasya bhaviSyati, kintu yo jano mAnavasutaM samarpayiSyate hanta tasya janmAbhAve sati bhadramabhaviSyat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>aparaJca teSAM bhojanasamaye yIzuH pUpaM gRhItvezvaraguNAn anukIrtya bhaGktvA tebhyo dattvA babhASe, etad gRhItvA bhuJjIdhvam etanmama vigraharUpaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>anantaraM sa kaMsaM gRhItvezvarasya guNAn kIrttayitvA tebhyo dadau, tataste sarvve papuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>aparaM sa tAnavAdId bahUnAM nimittaM pAtitaM mama navInaniyamarUpaM zoNitametat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>yuSmAnahaM yathArthaM vadAmi, Izvarasya rAjye yAvat sadyojAtaM drAkSArasaM na pAsyAmi,tAvadahaM drAkSAphalarasaM puna rna pAsyAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>tadanantaraM te gItamekaM saMgIya bahi rjaitunaM zikhariNaM yayuH</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>atha yIzustAnuvAca nizAyAmasyAM mayi yuSmAkaM sarvveSAM pratyUho bhaviSyati yato likhitamAste yathA, meSANAM rakSakaJcAhaM prahariSyAmi vai tataH| meSANAM nivaho nUnaM pravikIrNo bhaviSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>kantu madutthAne jAte yuSmAkamagre'haM gAlIlaM vrajiSyAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>tadA pitaraH pratibabhASe, yadyapi sarvveSAM pratyUho bhavati tathApi mama naiva bhaviSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>tato yIzuruktAvAn ahaM tubhyaM tathyaM kathayAmi, kSaNAdAyAmadya kukkuTasya dvitIyavAraravaNAt pUrvvaM tvaM vAratrayaM mAmapahnoSyase|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>kintu sa gADhaM vyAharad yadyapi tvayA sArddhaM mama prANo yAti tathApi kathamapi tvAM nApahnoSye; sarvve'pItare tathaiva babhASire|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>aparaJca teSu getzimAnInAmakaM sthAna gateSu sa ziSyAn jagAda, yAvadahaM prArthaye tAvadatra sthAne yUyaM samupavizata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>atha sa pitaraM yAkUbaM yohanaJca gRhItvA vavrAja; atyantaM trAsito vyAkulitazca tebhyaH kathayAmAsa,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>nidhanakAlavat prANo me'tIva daHkhameti, yUyaM jAgratotra sthAne tiSThata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>tataH sa kiJciddUraM gatvA bhUmAvadhomukhaH patitvA prArthitavAnetat, yadi bhavituM zakyaM tarhi duHkhasamayoyaM matto dUrIbhavatu|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>aparamuditavAn he pita rhe pitaH sarvveM tvayA sAdhyaM, tato hetorimaM kaMsaM matto dUrIkuru, kintu tan mamecchAto na tavecchAto bhavatu|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>tataH paraM sa etya tAn nidritAn nirIkSya pitaraM provAca, zimon tvaM kiM nidrAsi? ghaTikAmekAm api jAgarituM na zaknoSi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>parIkSAyAM yathA na patatha tadarthaM sacetanAH santaH prArthayadhvaM; mana udyuktamiti satyaM kintu vapurazaktikaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>atha sa punarvrajitvA pUrvvavat prArthayAJcakre|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>parAvRtyAgatya punarapi tAn nidritAn dadarza tadA teSAM locanAni nidrayA pUrNAni, tasmAttasmai kA kathA kathayitavyA ta etad boddhuM na zekuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>tataHparaM tRtIyavAraM Agatya tebhyo 'kathayad idAnImapi zayitvA vizrAmyatha? yatheSTaM jAtaM, samayazcopasthitaH pazyata mAnavatanayaH pApilokAnAM pANiSu samarpyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>uttiSThata, vayaM vrajAmo yo jano mAM parapANiSu samarpayiSyate pazyata sa samIpamAyAtaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>imAM kathAM kathayati sa, etarhidvAdazAnAmeko yihUdA nAmA ziSyaH pradhAnayAjakAnAm upAdhyAyAnAM prAcInalokAnAJca sannidheH khaGgalaguDadhAriNo bahulokAn gRhItvA tasya samIpa upasthitavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>aparaJcAsau parapANiSu samarpayitA pUrvvamiti saGketaM kRtavAn yamahaM cumbiSyAmi sa evAsau tameva dhRtvA sAvadhAnaM nayata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>ato hetoH sa Agatyaiva yozoH savidhaM gatvA he guro he guro, ityuktvA taM cucumba|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>tadA te tadupari pANInarpayitvA taM dadhnuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>tatastasya pArzvasthAnAM lokAnAmekaH khaGgaM niSkoSayan mahAyAjakasya dAsamekaM prahRtya tasya karNaM ciccheda|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>pazcAd yIzustAn vyAjahAra khaGgAn laguDAMzca gRhItvA mAM kiM cauraM dharttAM samAyAtAH?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>madhyemandiraM samupadizan pratyahaM yuSmAbhiH saha sthitavAnatahaM, tasmin kAle yUyaM mAM nAdIdharata, kintvanena zAstrIyaM vacanaM sedhanIyaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>tadA sarvve ziSyAstaM parityajya palAyAJcakrire|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>athaiko yuvA mAnavo nagnakAye vastramekaM nidhAya tasya pazcAd vrajan yuvalokai rdhRto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>vastraM vihAya nagnaH palAyAJcakre|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>aparaJca yasmin sthAne pradhAnayAjakA upAdhyAyAH prAcInalokAzca mahAyAjakena saha sadasi sthitAstasmin sthAne mahAyAjakasya samIpaM yIzuM ninyuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>pitaro dUre tatpazcAd itvA mahAyAjakasyATTAlikAM pravizya kiGkaraiH sahopavizya vahnitApaM jagrAha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>tadAnIM pradhAnayAjakA mantriNazca yIzuM ghAtayituM tatprAtikUlyena sAkSiNo mRgayAJcakrire, kintu na prAptAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v"/>anekaistadviruddhaM mRSAsAkSye dattepi teSAM vAkyAni na samagacchanta|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>sarvvazeSe kiyanta utthAya tasya prAtikUlyena mRSAsAkSyaM dattvA kathayAmAsuH,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v"/>idaM karakRtamandiraM vinAzya dinatrayamadhye punaraparam akarakRtaM mandiraM nirmmAsyAmi, iti vAkyam asya mukhAt zrutamasmAbhiriti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v"/>kintu tatrApi teSAM sAkSyakathA na saGgAtAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v"/>atha mahAyAjako madhyesabham utthAya yIzuM vyAjahAra, ete janAstvayi yat sAkSyamaduH tvametasya kimapyuttaraM kiM na dAsyasi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v"/>kintu sa kimapyuttaraM na datvA maunIbhUya tasyau; tato mahAyAjakaH punarapi taM pRSTAvAn tvaM saccidAnandasya tanayo 'bhiSiktastratA?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v"/>tadA yIzustaM provAca bhavAmyaham yUyaJca sarvvazaktimato dakSINapArzve samupavizantaM megha mAruhya samAyAntaJca manuSyaputraM sandrakSyatha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v"/>tadA mahAyAjakaH svaM vamanaM chitvA vyAvaharat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v"/>kimasmAkaM sAkSibhiH prayojanam? IzvaranindAvAkyaM yuSmAbhirazrAvi kiM vicArayatha? tadAnIM sarvve jagadurayaM nidhanadaNDamarhati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v"/>tataH kazcit kazcit tadvapuSi niSThIvaM nicikSepa tathA tanmukhamAcchAdya capeTena hatvA gaditavAn gaNayitvA vada, anucarAzca capeTaistamAjaghnuH</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v"/>tataH paraM pitare'TTAlikAdhaHkoSThe tiSThati mahAyAjakasyaikA dAsI sametya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v"/>taM vihnitApaM gRhlantaM vilokya taM sunirIkSya babhASe tvamapi nAsaratIyayIzoH saGginAm eko jana AsIH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v"/>kintu sopahnutya jagAda tamahaM na vadmi tvaM yat kathayami tadapyahaM na buddhye| tadAnIM pitare catvaraM gatavati kuेkkuTo rurAva|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v"/>athAnyA dAsI pitaraM dRSTvA samIpasthAn janAn jagAda ayaM teSAmeko janaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v"/>tataH sa dvitIyavAram apahnutavAn pazcAt tatrasthA lokAH pitaraM procustvamavazyaM teSAmeko janaH yatastvaM gAlIlIyo nara iti tavoccAraNaM prakAzayati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v"/>tadA sa zapathAbhizApau kRtvA provAca yUyaM kathAM kathayatha taM naraM na jAne'haM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v"/>tadAnIM dvitIyavAraM kukkuTo 'rAvIt| kukkuTasya dvitIyaravAt pUrvvaM tvaM mAM vAratrayam apahnoSyasi, iti yadvAkyaM yIzunA samuditaM tat tadA saMsmRtya pitaro roditum Arabhata|</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>atha prabhAte sati pradhAnayAjakAH prAJca upAdhyAyAH sarvve mantriNazca sabhAM kRtvA yIzuृM bandhayitva pIlAtAkhyasya dezAdhipateH savidhaM nItvA samarpayAmAsuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>tadA pIlAtastaM pRSTavAn tvaM kiM yihUdIyalokAnAM rAjA? tataH sa pratyuktavAn satyaM vadasi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>aparaM pradhAnayAjakAstasya bahuSu vAkyeSu doSamAropayAJcakruH kintu sa kimapi na pratyuvAca|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>tadAnIM pIlAtastaM punaH papraccha tvaM kiM nottarayasi? pazyaite tvadviruddhaM katiSu sAdhyeSu sAkSaM dadati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>kantu yIzustadApi nottaraM dadau tataH pIlAta AzcaryyaM jagAma|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>aparaJca kArAbaddhe kastiMzcit jane tanmahotsavakAle lokai ryAcite dezAdhipatistaM mocayati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>ye ca pUrvvamupaplavamakArSurupaplave vadhamapi kRtavantasteSAM madhye tadAnoM barabbAnAmaka eko baddha AsIt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>ato hetoH pUrvvAparIyAM rItikathAM kathayitvA lokA uccairuvantaH pIlAtasya samakSaM nivedayAmAsuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>tadA pIlAtastAnAcakhyau tarhi kiM yihUdIyAnAM rAjAnaM mocayiSyAmi? yuSmAbhiH kimiSyate?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>yataH pradhAnayAjakA IrSyAta eva yIzuM samArpayanniti sa viveda|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>kintu yathA barabbAM mocayati tathA prArthayituM pradhAnayAjakA lokAn pravarttayAmAsuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>atha pIlAtaH punaH pRSTavAn tarhi yaM yihUdIyAnAM rAjeti vadatha tasya kiM kariSyAmi yuSmAbhiH kimiSyate?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>tadA te punarapi proccaiH procustaM kruze vedhaya|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>tasmAt pIlAtaH kathitavAn kutaH? sa kiM kukarmma kRtavAn? kintu te punazca ruvanto vyAjahrustaM kruze vedhaya|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>tadA pIlAtaH sarvvAllokAn toSayitumicchan barabbAM mocayitvA yIzuM kazAbhiH prahRtya kruze veddhuM taM samarpayAmbabhUva|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>anantaraM sainyagaNo'TTAlikAm arthAd adhipate rgRhaM yIzuM nItvA senAnivahaM samAhuyat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>pazcAt te taM dhUmalavarNavastraM paridhApya kaNTakamukuTaM racayitvA zirasi samAropya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>he yihUdIyAnAM rAjan namaskAra ityuktvA taM namaskarttAmArebhire|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>tasyottamAGge vetrAghAtaM cakrustadgAtre niSThIvaJca nicikSipuH, tathA tasya sammukhe jAnupAtaM praNomuH</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>itthamupahasya dhUmravarNavastram uttAryya tasya vastraM taM paryyadhApayan kruze veddhuM bahirninyuzca|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>tataH paraM sekandarasya ruphasya ca pitA zimonnAmA kurINIyaloka ekaH kutazcid grAmAdetya pathi yAti taM te yIzoH kruzaM voDhuM balAd dadhnuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>atha gulgaltA arthAt ziraHkapAlanAmakaM sthAnaM yIzumAnIya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>te gandharasamizritaM drAkSArasaM pAtuM tasmai daduH kintu sa na jagrAha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>tasmin kruze viddhe sati teSAmekaikazaH kiM prApsyatIti nirNayAya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>tasya paridheyAnAM vibhAgArthaM guTikApAtaM cakruH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>aparam eSa yihUdIyAnAM rAjeti likhitaM doSapatraM tasya ziraUrdvvam AropayAJcakruH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>tasya vAmadakSiNayo rdvau caurau kruzayo rvividhAte|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>tenaiva "aparAdhijanaiH sArddhaM sa gaNito bhaviSyati," iti zAstroktaM vacanaM siddhamabhUta|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>anantaraM mArge ye ye lokA gamanAgamane cakruste sarvva eva zirAMsyAndolya nindanto jagaduH, re mandiranAzaka re dinatrayamadhye tannirmmAyaka,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>adhunAtmAnam avitvA kruzAdavaroha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>kiJca pradhAnayAjakA adhyApakAzca tadvat tiraskRtya parasparaM cacakSire eSa parAnAvat kintu svamavituM na zaknoti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>yadIsrAyelo rAjAbhiSiktastrAtA bhavati tarhyadhunaina kruzAdavarohatu vayaM tad dRSTvA vizvasiSyAmaH; kiJca yau lokau tena sArddhaM kruze 'vidhyetAM tAvapi taM nirbhartsayAmAsatuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>atha dvitIyayAmAt tRtIyayAmaM yAvat sarvvo dezaH sAndhakArobhUt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>tatastRtIyaprahare yIzuruccairavadat elI elI lAmA zivaktanI arthAd "he madIza madIza tvaM paryyatyAkSIH kuto hi mAM?"</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>tadA samIpasthalokAnAM kecit tadvAkyaM nizamyAcakhyuH pazyaiSa eliyam AhUyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>tata eko jano dhAvitvAgatya spaJje 'mlarasaM pUrayitvA taM naDAgre nidhAya pAtuM tasmai dattvAvadat tiSTha eliya enamavarohayitum eti na veti pazyAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>atha yIzuruccaiH samAhUya prANAn jahau|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>tadA mandirasya javanikordvvAdadhaHryyantA vidIrNA dvikhaNDAbhUt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>kiJca itthamuccairAhUya prANAn tyajantaM taM dRSdvA tadrakSaNAya niyukto yaH senApatirAsIt sovadat naroyam Izvaraputra iti satyam|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>tadAnIM magdalInI marisam kaniSThayAkUbo yosezca mAtAnyamariyam zAlomI ca yAH striyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>gAlIlpradeze yIzuM sevitvA tadanugAminyo jAtA imAstadanyAzca yA anekA nAryo yIzunA sArddhaM yirUzAlamamAyAtAstAzca dUrAt tAni dadRzuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>athAsAdanadinasyArthAd vizrAmavArAt pUrvvadinasya sAyaMkAla Agata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>IzvararAjyApekSyarimathIyayUSaphanAmA mAnyamantrI sametya pIlAtasavidhaM nirbhayo gatvA yIzordehaM yayAce|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>kintu sa idAnIM mRtaH pIlAta ityasambhavaM matvA zatasenApatimAhUya sa kadA mRta iti papraccha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>zatasemanApatimukhAt tajjJAtvA yUSaphe yIzordehaM dadau|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>pazcAt sa sUkSmaM vAsaH krItvA yIzoH kAyamavarohya tena vAsasA veSTAyitvA girau khAtazmazAne sthApitavAn pASANaM loThayitvA dvAri nidadhe|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>kintu yatra sosthApyata tata magdalInI mariyam yosimAtRmariyam ca dadRzatRH|</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>atha vizrAmavAre gate magdalInI mariyam yAkUbamAtA mariyam zAlomI cemAstaM marddayituM sugandhidravyANi krItvA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>saptAhaprathamadine'tipratyUSe sUryyodayakAle zmazAnamupagatAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>kintu zmazAnadvArapASANo'tibRhan taM ko'pasArayiSyatIti tAH parasparaM gadanti!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>etarhi nirIkSya pASANo dvAro 'pasArita iti dadRzuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>pazcAttAH zmazAnaM pravizya zuklavarNadIrghaparicchadAvRtamekaM yuvAnaM zmazAnadakSiNapArzva upaviSTaM dRSTvA camaccakruH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>so'vadat, mAbhaiSTa yUyaM kruze hataM nAsaratIyayIzuM gaveSayatha sotra nAsti zmazAnAdudasthAt; tai ryatra sa sthApitaH sthAnaM tadidaM pazyata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>kintu tena yathoktaM tathA yuSmAkamagre gAlIlaM yAsyate tatra sa yuSmAn sAkSAt kariSyate yUyaM gatvA tasya ziSyebhyaH pitarAya ca vArttAmimAM kathayata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>tAH kampitA vistitAzca tUrNaM zmazAnAd bahirgatvA palAyanta bhayAt kamapi kimapi nAvadaMzca|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>aparaM yIzuH saptAhaprathamadine pratyUSe zmazAnAdutthAya yasyAH saptabhUtAstyAjitAstasyai magdalInImariyame prathamaM darzanaM dadau|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>tataH sA gatvA zokarodanakRdbhyo'nugatalokebhyastAM vArttAM kathayAmAsa|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>kintu yIzuH punarjIvan tasyai darzanaM dattavAniti zrutvA te na pratyayan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>pazcAt teSAM dvAyo rgrAmayAnakAle yIzuranyavezaM dhRtvA tAbhyAM darzana dadau!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>tAvapi gatvAnyaziSyebhyastAM kathAM kathayAJcakratuH kintu tayoH kathAmapi te na pratyayan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>zeSata ekAdazaziSyeSu bhojanopaviSTeSu yIzustebhyo darzanaM dadau tathotthAnAt paraM taddarzanaprAptalokAnAM kathAyAmavizvAsakaraNAt teSAmavizvAsamanaHkAThinyAbhyAM hetubhyAM sa tAMstarjitavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>atha tAnAcakhyau yUyaM sarvvajagad gatvA sarvvajanAn prati susaMvAdaM pracArayata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>tatra yaH kazcid vizvasya majjito bhavet sa paritrAsyate kintu yo na vizvasiSyati sa daNDayiSyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>kiJca ye pratyeSyanti tairIdRg AzcaryyaM karmma prakAzayiSyate te mannAmnA bhUtAn tyAjayiSyanti bhASA anyAzca vadiSyanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>aparaM taiH sarpeSu dhRteSu prANanAzakavastuni pIte ca teSAM kApi kSati rna bhaviSyati; rogiNAM gAtreSu karArpite te'rogA bhaviSyanti ca|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>atha prabhustAnityAdizya svargaM nItaH san paramezvarasya dakSiNa upaviveza|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>tataste prasthAya sarvvatra susaMvAdIyakathAM pracArayitumArebhire prabhustu teSAM sahAyaH san prakAzitAzcaryyakriyAbhistAM kathAM pramANavatIM cakAra| iti|</para>
</usx>
